 R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] Q1体力第2步：人脉维护(+1,尊严+1)，Network为短板。剩余1点体力待分配。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Health now 5, energy 2 remaining. Let me allocate the remaining 2 energy.\n\nCurrent: H=5 D=10 S=9 N=2 O=1 W=1 L=L1 E=2.\n\nOptions with 2 energy:\n- 技能学习 (2): Skill +1, Health -1 → S 10, H 4\n- 高强度工作 (2): Output +2, Health -1, Dignity -1\n- 人脉维护 (1) + 准备汇报材料 (1): N +1, D +1, O +1, D +1 → N 3, O 2, D 12\n- 人脉维护 (1) + 健康恢复 (1): N +1, D +1, H +2\n\nFor promotion (Skill/Network/Output thresholds), N=2 and O=1 are the deficits. Skill 9 is high.\n\nBest balanced: 人脉维护 (1) + 准备汇报材料 (1) = 2 energy → N+1, O+1, D+2. This improves the two deficit dimensions (Network, Output) plus dignity. Health stays 5.\n\nAlternatively 技能学习 (2) → S+1 only, H-1. Less multi-dimension.\n\nI'll go with 人脉维护 (choice 3) then 准备汇报材料 (choice 7). Submit one at a time.\n\nLet me do choice 3 first (人脉维护).\n\nActually, since it's one-at-a-time with observe, let me do choice 3.\n\nPLAN: G=? P=A checkpoint=Q1 energy step2\nCANDIDATE: choice=3 reason=Network=2 是进展短板，花 1 点维护人脉（+1）并 +1 尊严，成本低收益多。\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 3."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_8zyppbA5uniivyL4BJj22554"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_jQtzDrn5C5lzmn5sK4Q49932", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":3,\"current_quarter\":1,\"current_year\":1},\"status\":{\"health\":5,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":9,\"network\":3,\"level\":\"L1\",\"duration_in_level\":3,\"output\":1,\"wealth\":1,\"energy\":1},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\