n_in_level=6\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 C；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L1→L2 已晋升\nSTICKY: 负向正式绩效 C + \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧\nEFFECTS: 备考计划 action → H-1 (attributable, single action then fresh observe)\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=空降副总谈话引发猜疑\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=主动向老周同步韩总的问题与答复，透明化解猜疑、维护与直属 Leader 的信任，优于张扬、沉默或私下经营韩总关系。\n\nRISK: ALLOW — 触及与直属 Leader 的信任/职场猜疑，全量复核；choice 1 以透明同步处理，属风险处理型选择。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_ZxnxED2bzKJrjKFW1RjR8292", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=ALLOW X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 主动向老周同步韩总问题与答复，透明化解猜疑、维护直属Leader信任。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: new VP chatted with you, colleagues gossiping. Choices:\n1. Proactively sync with 老周 about 韩总's questions and your answers — transparency, manages relationship with direct leader.\n2. Don't make a fuss, deliver normally.\n3. Privately invite 韩总's colleague to dinner to deepen impression — political maneuvering, risky.\n\nBoard: M=11 Q=4, H=5 D=10 S=21 N=7 O=6 W=5 L=L2 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1 — proactive transparency with direct leader, avoids suspicion, builds trust.\n\nRisk: PASS/ALLOW. It's a relationship/trust matter. Choice 1 handles → ALLOW.\n\nHmm, actually it's fairly ordinary. Quick gate PASS? It touches office politics/trust with direct leader. I'll do ALLOW (full review since it touches trust/relationship). Actually, let me keep PASS if ordinary. Hmm. The event is about managing perception with your direct leader (老周). Choice 1 is transparent. I'll say PASS (ordinary relationship management). Actually to be consistent, earlier relationship events I used PASS. But this touches potential trust/retaliation dynamics (老周 suddenly polite, gossip about replacing Leader). I'll use ALLOW.\n\nHmm, let me keep it simple: PASS for ordinary, ALLOW when it touches material trust/compliance. This touches trust/relationship with leader amid succession rumors → ALLOW.\n\nTake action 1.\n\nHealth dropped to 5. Watch it. No explicit symptom yet."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_ZxnxED2bzKJrjKFW1RjR8292"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_VQCWsbuccEhXh6XwGA6M8034", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":12,\"current_quarter\":4,\"current_year\":1},\"status\":{\"health\":5,\"dignity\":9,\"skill\":21,\"network\":4,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":6,\"wealth\":5,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"竞标方案答辩PK对手长链\",\"description\":\"你用扎实的技术方案和总拥有成本测算，把「为什么值这个价」讲得有理有据，技术评委频频点头。但采购评委仍盯着报价问：「比对手贵了不少，怎么说服我们老板？」\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"给出分阶段付款+可量化的ROI模型，把价值落到采购能复述的话术上\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"只强调技术，对报价问题避而不答\"}],\"events\":\"【半年谈话】直属 Leader 约你到小会议室，就过去半年的表现做一次一对一反馈：\\\\n\\\\n反馈里夹杂着几条具体事项：进度、协作、风险意识。Leader 最后总结：「没有要批你的意思，但别让人觉得你‘只会忙、不会赢’。半年后我会用同一套标准再看你。」\\\\n\\\\n半年绩效奖金（B）：+0.2\\\\n\\\\n本月基本工资到账：+0.4（L2）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\\\\n\\\\n晋升通知：半年组织评审通过，您已从 L2 晋升至 L3（高级工程师）。\\\\n\\\\n升迁节奏过快，原有人脉圈还没消化你的新身份——协作摩擦上升，办公室侧目增多。\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_VQCWsbuccEhXh6XwGA6M8034"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "重大更新：晋升 L2→L3，半年绩效 B（奖金 +0.2），Leader 仍强调\"只会忙、不会赢\"；升迁过快致协作摩擦上升、办公室侧目。\n\nBoard:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=12 Q=4\nSTATE: H=5 D=9 S=21 N=4 O=6 W=5 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（奖金 +0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦上升、办公室侧目（人脉/关系警示）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N-3,D-1 等，晋升/奖金/事件叠加，不可归因）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=竞标答辩应对报价质疑\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=给出分阶段付款+可量化 ROI 模型，把价值翻译成采购能复述的话术，正面回应报价、拿下竞标，优于只讲技术避答。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通答辩应对，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_LUu4PpovjoHufz9Ge57S9606", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 给出分阶段付款+可量化ROI模型，把价值翻译成采购话术，正面回应报价。已晋升L3；缺口=可见成果+消化新身份。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Big update: promoted L2→L3! Half-year performance B (+0.2). Leader feedback again \"只会忙、不会赢\". Also: \"升迁节奏过快，原有人脉圈还没消化你的新身份——协作摩擦上升，办公室侧目增多\" — this is a Network concern. N dropped from 7 to 4, D 10→9.\n\nBoard update:\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=12 Q=4\nSTATE: H=5 D=9 S=21 N=4 O=6 W=5 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（奖金 +0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: 负向绩效（改善至B但仍\"只会忙不会赢\"）；协作摩擦上升/办公室侧目（人脉未消化新身份）\nEFFECTS: MIXED\nUNKNOWN: none\n\nHmm, the review improved from C to B. But the Leader still says \"只会忙不会赢\". So the progression concern remains. Also new: collaboration friction, office side-eye (Network concern).\n\nCurrent event: bid defense follow-up — procurement asks about price. Choices:\n1. Give staged payment + quantifiable ROI model, translate value into procurement's language — good.\n2. Only emphasize tech, dodge the price question — bad.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nBoard: M=12 Q=4, H=5 D=9 S=21 N=4 O=6 W=5 L=L3 E=0.\n\nSTICKY: review concern (只会忙不会赢) + collaboration friction/office side-eye (Network isolation warning? \"协作摩擦上升，办公室侧目增多\" — this is a sustained Network/relationship concern). Per STICKY rules: \"sustained Network isolation or an explicit isolation warning\". This is explicit. So STICKY includes it.\n\nREVIEW_PLAN update: Primary Gap = visible wins (Output) + now also network/friction. Hmm. The main gap remains \"只会忙不会赢\" (visible wins). But the new signal adds collaboration friction.\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=竞标答辩应对报价\nCANDIDATE: choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_LUu4PpovjoHufz9Ge57S9606"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_HU0laasTvEkUS2bewYdu9267", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":12,\"current_quarter\":4,\"current_year\":1},\"status\":{\"health\":5,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":23,\"network\":5,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":8,\"wealth\":5,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"同事约你一起去找领导集体谈薪\",\"description\":\"几个对薪资不满的同事串联起来，想集体去找领导『一起施压要求普涨』，拉你入伙：『人多力量大，你也来！』集体行动有风险，也容易被当成『闹事』。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"婉拒抱团施压，选择基于个人贡献单独、理性地争取自己的调薪\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"为合群带头加入集体逼宫、向领导施压\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"既想跟又怕担责，含糊答应又临阵退缩\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_HU0laasTvEkUS2bewYdu9267"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=12 Q=4\nSTATE: H=5 D=10 S=23 N=5 O=8 W=5 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2,N+1,O+2 after 报价应答 action; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=集体谈薪邀请\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=婉拒抱团施压、改为基于个人贡献单独理性争取调薪，规避\"闹事\"风险并守住职业形象，优于带头逼宫或含糊退缩。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通职场选择，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_vcAdJtD2I7ixS0ElmAf20325", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 婉拒抱团施压，改为基于个人贡献单独理性争取调薪，规避闹事风险。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: colleagues want collective salary negotiation. Choices:\n1. Decline collective pressure, negotiate individually based on personal contribution — good.\n2. Lead the collective confrontation — risky.\n3. Ambiguously agree then back out — bad.\n\nBoard: M=12 Q=4, H=5 D=10 S=23 N=5 O=8 W=5 L=L3 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1 — individual, rational negotiation based on contribution.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_vcAdJtD2I7ixS0ElmAf20325"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_KbE34V4JoSmzxIpvRDxx3083", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":12,\"current_quarter\":4,\"current_year\":1},\"status\":{\"health\":5,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":24,\"network\":5,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":8,\"wealth\":5,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"依赖团队延期是否公开升级\",\"description\":\"你的项目关键依赖兄弟团队承诺的交付已延期两周，对方Tech Lead私下表示\\'还需要一周\\'但不愿更新官方排期。你的项目风险在高层汇报中即将暴露，你可以选择私下继续协调或正式升级。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"向高层正式升级风险，要求明确依赖交付承诺\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"继续私下协调，给对方额外一周缓冲并准备临时方案\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_KbE34V4JoSmzxIpvRDxx3083"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=12 Q=4\nSTATE: H=5 D=10 S=24 N=5 O=8 W=5 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: 个人调薪 action → S+1 (attributable, single action then fresh observe)\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=关键依赖延期风险处置\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=向高层正式升级风险并要求明确交付承诺，透明暴露风险、保护项目与自身，避免依赖方拖延导致汇报时被动，优于继续私下协调。\n\nRISK: ALLOW — 触及项目风险/跨团队信任，全量复核；choice 1 主动升级并求承诺，属风险处理型选择。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_tuXrSNM1FLgGYSz5aT5g0271", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=ALLOW X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 向高层正式升级依赖延期风险并要求明确交付承诺，透明暴露、保护项目。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: dependency team delay — escalate officially or continue private coordination. Choices:\n1. Formally escalate risk to senior leadership, demand clear delivery commitment.\n2. Continue private coordination, give them an extra week buffer, prepare temporary solution.\n\nBoard: M=12 Q=4, H=5 D=10 S=24 N=5 O=8 W=5 L=L3 E=0.\n\nWhich is best? The project risk is about to be exposed in a high-level report. Choices:\n1. Formal escalation — transparent, protects yourself, forces commitment.\n2. Private coordination + buffer + temp solution — keeps relationship but risk remains.\n\nHmm. The game has rewarded transparency. But also relationship management. Formal escalation is transparent and protects the project, but may damage cross-team relationship. Private coordination preserves relationship but leaves risk.\n\nGiven the risk is about to be exposed in a high-level report, and the dependency is 2 weeks late, formal escalation is the responsible move (visibility + accountability). This aligns with transparency. \n\nHmm, but choice 2 (buffer + temp solution) also shows initiative. However, the Tech Lead won't update the official schedule — that's a red flag; private coordination may fail and the risk surfaces at the worst time.\n\nI'll choose choice 1: formal escalation — transparent, forces accountability, aligns with the game's transparency reward.\n\nRisk: ALLOW (touches project risk/trust, handles it).\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_tuXrSNM1FLgGYSz5aT5g0271"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_bwCPlB1MehY6wO96Y9j08562", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":12,\"current_quarter\":4,\"current_year\":1},\"status\":{\"health\":5,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":24,\"network\":3,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":9,\"wealth\":5,\"energy\":3},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":3,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_bwCPlB1MehY6wO96Y9j08562"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Q4 体力分配。Network 骤降至 3，出现协作摩擦警示，成为新短板；Health=5 需兼顾。\n\nBoard:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=12 Q=4\nSTATE: H=5 D=10 S=24 N=3 O=9 W=5 L=L3 E=3\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦上升、办公室侧目（人脉警示）\nEFFECTS: 依赖风险升级 action → N-2,O+1 (attributable, single action then fresh observe)\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nQUARTER_INTENT = A | 目标：修复人脉（消化新身份/协作摩擦）并守住健康 | 剩余体力优先 Network+健康\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=Q4 体力第1步\nCANDIDATE: choice=3 reason=Network=3 骤降且有协作摩擦警示，人脉维护 +1 Network +1 Dignity，成本低，直接缓解关系短板。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规关系维护，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_4Iprm08cnktrQCBRTx8p8915", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 3, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] Q4体力第1步：人脉维护(+1 Network,+1 Dignity)，Network骤降至3、有协作摩擦警示，优先修复。剩余2点待分配。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Q4 end energy allocation. Wait — month 12 is end of Q4 (year 1). Hmm, but the description says \"新的一个季度开始了\". This is the Q4 energy allocation (month 12).\n\nCurrent: H=5 D=10 S=24 N=3 O=9 W=5 L=L3 E=3.\n\nNetwork dropped to 3 (from 5). The collaboration friction/office side-eye concern is materializing. Network is now the deficit. Also the review gap = visible wins (Output=9, now decent).\n\nHmm, N=3 is low. And STICKY has the \"协作摩擦/侧目\" concern. So I should address Network.\n\nAllocate 3 energy:\n- 人脉维护 (1): N+1, D+1\n- 健康恢复 (1): H+2\n- 准备汇报材料 (1): O+1, D+1\n\nOr focus on Network: 人脉维护 ×2 + 健康恢复 = N+2, D+2, H+2. N=5, H=7.\n\nOr 人脉维护 (1) + 准备汇报材料 (1) + 健康恢复 (1) = N+1, O+1, D+2, H+2.\n\nGiven N=3 is the new deficit and there's an explicit collaboration friction concern, prioritize Network. Let me do 人脉维护 ×2 + 健康恢复 (1) = N+2 (N=5), H+2 (H=7), D+2 (capped).\n\nHmm, or 人脉维护 ×3 = N+3 (N=6), D+3. H stays 5.\n\nHealth 5 — I'd like to recover it. Let me do 人脉维护 ×2 + 健康恢复 (1): N=5, H=7.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: Output=9 is now decent (gap improving). Network=3 is the new concern. Health=5 moderate.\n\nPlan: 人脉维护 (1) + 人脉维护 (1) + 健康恢复 (1) → N+2, H+2, D+2. N=5, H=7.\n\nQUARTER_INTENT = A | 目标：修复人脉（消化新身份/协作摩擦）并守住健康 | 剩余体力优先 Network+健康\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=Q4 体力第1步\nCANDIDATE: choice=3 reason=Network=3 骤降且有协作摩擦警示，人脉维护 +1 Network +1 Dignity，成本低，直接缓解关系短板。\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 3."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_4Iprm08cnktrQ