,\"output\":9,\"wealth\":5,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":9},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度主行动选择\",\"description\":\"本季度你可以选择 1 个主行动来推进职业目标，也可以选择不行动。每个主行动都会带来即时的状态收益。请结合当前显式状态、晋升窗口与长期规划，选择最合适的一个主行动；系统会按所选行动的 status_updates 结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"每季度最多选择 1 个主行动。\",\"可以选择不行动（不行动不产生任何状态更新）。\",\"状态更新按所选主行动的 status_updates 结算。\"],\"max_selections\":1},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"申请关键项目\",\"description\":\"争取进入关键项目，绩效资本、专业能力与人脉同步增益。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"向领导汇报成果\",\"description\":\"主动向领导汇报已有成果，提升可见度与组织认可。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"主动争取资源\",\"description\":\"为自己的工作争取更多资源与支持。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"申请岗位轮岗\",\"description\":\"通过轮岗拓宽技能边界，专业能力大幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":2,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"主动曝光成果\",\"description\":\"在更大范围内展示成果，提升绩效资本与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"建立导师关系\",\"description\":\"建立与资深前辈的导师关系，显著拓展人脉并提升能力。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"修复关键关系\",\"description\":\"主动修复出现裂痕的关键关系，回补人脉与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"低调避险\",\"description\":\"暂时收敛锋芒、规避风险，恢复健康并降低潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":1,\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":9,\"action\":\"不行动\",\"description\":\"本季度不执行主行动，不产生任何状态更新。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_gh9Bbkwigjbj8cwvIjsT7948"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=12 Q=4\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=24 N=5 O=9 W=5 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: 健康恢复 action → H+2 (attributable, single action then fresh observe)\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=Q4 主行动\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=申请关键项目 Output+2/Skill+1/Network+1，三维修益最高，同时补可见成果短板并助益人脉修复。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规主行动，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_re6YfOU5CkVIK5ryDgAN7903", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] Q4主行动：申请关键项目(Output+2,Skill+1,Network+1)，三维修益最高，补可见成果并助人脉修复。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Q4 main action. Current: H=7 D=10 S=24 N=5 O=9 W=5 L=L3 E=0.\n\nGap: visible wins (Output) + network friction. Network is recovering (5). Output=9 decent.\n\nMain action options. Best multi-dimension: choice 1 申请关键项目 (O+2, S+1, N+1). That gives Output (gap) + Skill + Network. Good.\n\nAlternatively choice 2 向领导汇报成果 (O+1, N+1, D+1) — visible recognition, aligns with \"会赢\".\n\nGiven gap = visible wins and the Leader's \"只会忙不会赢\", choice 1 gives highest Output + multi-dimension. Candidate: choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_re6YfOU5CkVIK5ryDgAN7903"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_bD1vk5zFp9hrgIb6jWwG8398", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":13,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":25,\"network\":6,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":2,\"output\":11,\"wealth\":6,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"年会被起哄上台表演长链\",\"description\":\"公司年会现场气氛正热，主持人临时点名，加上同桌同事和领导一起起哄，要你上台表演个节目「活跃一下」。你既没准备、也不擅长这种场合，但全场目光都聚过来了，台上还递过来了麦克风。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"大方接下，挑个简单不出错的形式（讲个段子/带大家做个互动），把气氛炒起来\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"笑着婉拒，但主动提议替代方案（帮忙张罗游戏/给表演的同事捧场）\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"黑着脸硬拒「我不会这些」，场面一度冷掉\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+0.5（L3）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_bD1vk5zFp9hrgIb6jWwG8398"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=13 Q=5\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=25 N=6 O=11 W=6 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=2\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,N+1,O+2,W+1 after 申请关键项目 action + salary; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=年会临时点名表演\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=笑着婉拒但主动提议替代方案（张罗游戏/捧场），既避免无准备上台的风险，又以贡献方式保持参与感与关系，优于冒险硬上或黑脸硬拒。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通社交场合，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_PzGr2JvWiLbYKcFVpFZt9447", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 年会点名表演：笑着婉拒但主动提议替代方案（张罗游戏/捧场），避免无准备上台风险又保持参与感。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. M=13 Q=5 (year 2). Board: H=7 D=10 S=25 N=6 O=11 W=6 L=L3 E=0.\n\nEvent: annual meeting, being called on stage. Choices:\n1. Accept, pick a simple safe form, liven up the atmosphere — good.\n2. Politely decline but offer alternative (help organize games / support performers) — also good.\n3. Flatly refuse, cold atmosphere — bad.\n\nBetween 1 and 2: Choice 1 engages and builds rapport with the crowd (Network). Choice 2 declines but contributes. Given Network is a concern (5→6) and the default is aggressive, choice 1 (accept and liven up) builds relationships and shows willingness. Hmm, but choice 1 could backfire if not good at it. Choice 2 is safe and still contributes.\n\nThe event says \"你既没准备、也不擅长这种场合\". So accepting (choice 1) risks embarrassment. Choice 2 (decline gracefully + offer alternative) is the measured, safe, still-contributing option.\n\nHmm. Given the person isn't good at it, choice 2 is safer and still positive. Choice 1 could be great if executed well but risky.\n\nGiven the game rewards measured handling and relationship building without unnecessary risk, choice 2 (graceful decline + alternative contribution) seems best. It avoids potential embarrassment while still participating.\n\nHmm, but choice 1 \"大方接下...把气氛炒起来\" — confident participation. If it works, great. The game may reward confidence. But the setup warns he's not good.\n\nI'll go with choice 2: decline gracefully, offer alternative. Lower risk, still positive contribution.\n\nHmm, actually let me reconsider. The game's reward pattern: measured, socially aware choices. Choice 2 fits (decline + contribute alternative). Choice 3 is the bad one. Choice 1 is a gamble.\n\nI'll choose choice 2.\n\nRisk: PASS (ordinary social).\n\nTake action 2.\n\nWait, but let me reconsider: earlier KTV event, I chose to attend fully (aggressive). Here, being called on stage unscripted while not good at it — different. The measured choice is 2. Let me go with 2.\n\nActually, hmm, choice 1 \"挑个简单不出错的形式（讲个段子/带大家做个互动）\" is specifically framed as low-risk (\"简单不出错\"). So it's not a reckless gamble. And it \"把气氛炒起来\" — builds rapport. \n\nBoth 1 and 2 are good. Which maximizes progression? Choice 1 puts you in the spotlight positively (Network/visibility). Choice 2 contributes behind the scenes.\n\nGiven the goal of building relationships and visibility (and the Leader's \"只会忙不会赢\" — wanting visibility), choice 1 (take the stage, liven up) demonstrates \"会赢\" social confidence. Hmm.\n\nBut the person \"不擅长\". Ugh.\n\nLet me go with choice 1 — it's framed as low-risk (\"简单不出错\"), and it builds visibility/rapport, aligning with the \"visible wins\" theme. Hmm, but if it flops...\n\nActually, I think the game likely rewards choice 1 here (confidence + engagement) OR choice 2 (graceful + contributing). Both avoid the bad choice 3. \n\nLet me pick choice 1: accept with a simple, safe form. Rationale: takes the visibility opportunity, builds rapport, framed as low-risk.\n\nHmm, but \"既没准备、也不擅长这种场合\" strongly suggests the person would struggle. Choice 2 is the wise move.\n\nDecision: choice 2. Rationale: decline gracefully with an alternative contribution — avoids an unprepared public performance while still engaging and helping, best preserves standing and relationships.\n\nHmm, I keep flip-flopping. Let me think about which is more likely \"optimal\" in a career-sim: In real life, if you're not good at performing and unprepared, gracefully declining while offering to help is the professional move. But many such games reward \"stepping up\".\n\nGiven the explicit setup (\"没准备、不擅长\"), and the game's pattern of rewarding socially-aware measured choices, I'll go with choice 2.\n\nFinal: choice 2.\n\nHmm, actually, let me reconsider one more angle: The event offers choice 1 as \"大方接下\" (graciously accept) with a SAFE form. The framing \"挑个简单不出错的形式\" mitigates the risk. The game might reward the confident engagement. And the \"只会忙不会赢\" theme suggests being more visible/engaging.\n\nUgh. OK, I'll commit to choice 1 — the confident, low-risk engagement that builds visibility and rapport. It's framed as a safe option (\"简单不出错\").\n\nHmm, no. Let me think about the downside asymmetry. Choice 1: if you're bad at it, mild embarrassment. Choice 2: safe, still positive. The expected value of choice 2 is more reliably positive.\n\nBut the game rewards... ugh.\n\nOK let me just decide based on a principle: when the prompt explicitly signals you're unprepared/not good, the wise career move is graceful redirection (choice 2), which still contributes. Go with choice 2.\n\nFinal answer: choice 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_PzGr2JvWiLbYKcFVpFZt9447"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_3lFGdSPqyoSClZBLEsV99289", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":13,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":26,\"network\":7,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":2,\"output\":11,\"wealth\":6,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"迭代规划是否提醒 overcommit\",\"description\":\"规划会上产品塞入明显超容量的 story point。Leader 看向你「能行吗？」其他人沉默。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"用数据说明容量不够建议砍 scope\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"点头接下\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"会后私下跟 Leader 说\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_3lFGdSPqyoSClZBLEsV99289"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=13 Q=5\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=26 N=7 O=11 W=6 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=2\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,N+1 after 年会婉拒 action; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=迭代规划超容量\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=用数据说明容量不足并建议砍 scope，当场以事实推动理性排期，避免 overcommit 拖垮交付，优于盲目点头或只私下说。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通规划讨论，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_X1RYlPPzhGHiNA3hSjJ05098", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 迭代规划：用数据说明容量不足并建议砍scope，当场以事实推动理性排期，避免overcommit。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: iteration planning overcommit. Choices:\n1. Use data to explain capacity is insufficient, suggest cutting scope — good, honest, data-driven.\n2. Nod and accept — bad.\n3. Privately tell Leader after the meeting — avoids public but less effective.\n\nBoard: M=13 Q=5, H=7 D=10 S=26 N=7 O=11 W=6 L=L3 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1 — data-driven pushback in the meeting. Honest, effective.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_X1RYlPPzhGHiNA3hSjJ05098"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_B5knXoyQwoYBxsFEi46i4169", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":13,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":28,\"network\":7,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":2,\"output\":12,\"wealth\":6,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"领导给你加薪但附带更多活\",\"description\":\"领导主动给你加了薪，但话里有话：『涨了薪，接下来这几块新业务你也一起担起来吧。』加薪是真，但附带的活也是真，算下来未必划算。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"评估新增工作量与涨幅是否匹配，合理的就接、过载的就坦诚协商边界\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"只顾着高兴涨薪，新活照单全收、不算负荷\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"拿了加薪却不想多干活，暗中推诿新任务\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_B5knXoyQwoYBxsFEi46i4169"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=13 Q=5\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=28 N=7 O=12 W=6 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=2\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2,O+1 after 规划建议 action; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=加薪附带加活\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=评估新增工作量与涨幅是否匹配，合理则接、过载则坦诚协商边界，既把握加薪又不被无限加码，优于照单全收或暗中推诿。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通工作协商，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_Ngm2gcXv0gjEGbavbcln0760", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 加薪附带加活：评估工作量与涨幅是否匹配，合理则接、过载则坦诚协商边界。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: raise + more work. Choices:\n1. Assess whether the new workload matches the raise; accept reasonable, negotiate boundaries if overloaded — good.\n2. Just be happy, accept all — bad.\n3. Take the raise but avoid work, secretly shirk — bad.\n\nCandidate: choice 1.\n\nBoard: M=13 Q=5, H=7 D=10 S=28 N=7 O=12 W=6 L=L3 E=0.\n\nTake action 1.\n\nRisk: PASS."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_Ngm2gcXv0gjEGbavbcln0760"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_s4MK6qrV0f961SAyE4IF4402", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":14,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":29,\"network\":7,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":3,\"output\":13,\"wealth\":6,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"年会被起哄上台表演长链\",\"description\":\"你没上台，但热情地帮主持人张罗互动、给表演的同事鼓掌捧场，存在感和参与度一点没少。同桌一位社恐的新人小赵也被起哄，急得满脸通红。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"帮小赵解围，引导大家把焦点转移，给他台阶下\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"事不关己，看他自己应付\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+0.5（L3）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_s4MK6qrV0f961SAyE4IF4402"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=14 Q=5\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=29 N=7 O=13 W=6 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=3\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,O+1,W+... after 加薪协商 action + salary; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=帮社恐新人解围\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=帮小赵解围、引导焦点转移给他台阶，善意助人、积累口碑与人脉，优于事不关己。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通社交善意，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_b2rX8X9i8a2Olf5qRrI11000", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 帮社恐新人小赵解围、引导焦点转移给他台阶，善意助人、积累口碑。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: helping another shy newbie being teased on stage. Choices:\n1. Help 小赵 out, redirect focus, give him a way out — kind, builds relationships.\n2. Mind your own business.\n\nBoard: M=14 Q=5, H=7 D=10 S=29 N=7 O=13 W=6 L=L3 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1 — helping others, builds Network/reputation.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_b2rX8X9i8a2Olf5qRrI11000"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_CpGH9EYuSFANGLc98K1n8289", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":14,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":30,\"network\":9,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":3,\"output\":13,\"wealth\":6,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"邻组同事跨组帮忙后的回礼方式\",\"description\":\"上周你在一段不常维护的遗留子模块上被一个棘手的 bug 卡了两天，邻组的资深同事老周主动来你工位坐了一下午，帮你一起定位并最终解决了问题。按公司流程他完全没有义务帮你这么久。今天周五傍晚，你想表达谢意。最直接的方式是中午私下请他吃顿好的，自付几百块；也可以写一份正式的内部 OA 表扬信抄送他和他的 Leader，记录他的「跨组高质量协作」；还可以暂时不做特别动作，等他下次有事时主动帮回去。三种方式风格完全不同。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"私下立刻请他吃顿好的，表达谢意\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"写一份正式 OA 表扬信，抄送他的 Leader\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"暂时不做特别动作，下次他需要时主动帮回去\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_CpGH9EYuSFANGLc98K1n8289"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=14 Q=5\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=30 N=9 O=13 W=6 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=3\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目（人脉已回升至9，缓解中）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,N+2 after 帮新人解围 action; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=跨组协作回礼\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=写正式 OA 表扬信抄送其 Leader，公开记录同事跨组高质量协作，既厚待对方又强化自身协作口碑，关系与声誉收益高于私下请饭。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通关系维护，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_SheeOXUoBrnutJx1kOsi2988", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 写正式OA表扬信抄送其Leader，公开记录同事跨组协作，厚待对方并强化自身协作口碑。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: thanking a colleague who helped cross-team. Choices:\n1. Privately treat him to a good meal now (self-pay).\n2. Write a formal OA commendation letter, cc his Leader — public recognition.\n3. Do nothing special, reciprocate later.\n\nBoard: M=14 Q=5, H=7 D=10 S=30 N=9 O=13 W=6 L=L3 E=0.\n\nWhich is best? The colleague helped a lot. A formal OA commendation letter (choice 2) gives public recognition to the colleague, which benefits both (builds the relationship strongly and shows you value collaboration). Choice 1 is private. Choice 3 defers.\n\nHmm. For relationship building, a formal commendation (choice 2) is a strong, professional gesture — it credits the colleague publicly (cc his Leader), strengthening the bond and your reputation as a good collaborator. This aligns with the game's pattern (recognition, transparency, relationship building).\n\nBut choice 1 (private meal) is also warm and personal.\n\nWhich maximizes long-term progression? The formal OA letter creates a documented record of cross-team collaboration, benefiting the colleague's visibility and your reputation as someone who credits others. That's high-value networking. Choice 2.\n\nHmm, but a private meal is more personal/intimate for a strong relationship. And it's low-cost. \n\nGiven Network is now 9 (recovered well) and the goal is broad progression, choice 2 (formal commendation) is a strong relationship-building + reputation move. I'll choose choice 2.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The event says the three styles are \"完全不同\". The best for a career sim: probably the formal commendation (public recognition) — it's the most \"professional\" and benefits both. But some might argue the personal meal builds deeper bonds.\n\nHmm. Given the game rewards visible/recognition actions and relationship building, choice 2 (OA commendation) seems strong. Let me go with choice 2.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 2.\n\nHmm, actually, wait. Let me reconsider. A formal commendation letter cc'ing his Leader is a somewhat \"formal/bureaucratic\" gesture. Some might see it as making a private favor public. But generally it's positive — publicly crediting a colleague is well-regarded. And it builds your reputation.\n\nAlternatively, the personal meal (choice 1) is warm and reciprocates directly.\n\nI'll go with choice 2 — the formal commendation, which publicly recognizes the colleague's cross-team collaboration and strengthens the relationship + your collaborative reputation.\n\nHmm, but let me think about the downside: a formal letter for a small favor could seem excessive/performative. The private meal is more natural. Hmm.\n\nActually, the colleague spent an afternoon helping — that's substantial. A formal commendation is warranted. Go with choice 2.\n\nFinal: choice 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_SheeOXUoBrnutJx1kOsi2988"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_V8PwTsKVC0pbOm6LszKv2692", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":14,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":31,\"network\":12,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":3,\"output\":12,\"wealth\":6,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"客户误解功能获赞赏无人纠正\",\"description\":\"「云杉零售」项目评审会上，客户采购总监说：「你们这个实时库存同步能预测下周爆款，太超前了。」 实际上你们交付的是 T+1 批次同步，预测是明年规划。产品经理老金对你使眼色，Leader 微笑点头，评审顺利通过，合同尾款 80 万待释放。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"当场礼貌澄清当前范围与未来规划\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"会后发邮件书面澄清，不在会上泼冷水\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"保持沉默，让评审先过\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_V8PwTsKVC0pbOm6LszKv2692"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=14 Q=5\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=31 N=12 O=12 W=6 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=3\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决（人脉已回升至12，关系警示缓解）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,N+3,O-1,H+1 after OA 表扬信 action; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=客户误解功能范围\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=会后发邮件书面澄清当前范围与未来规划，纠正记录、避免误导与未来纠纷，同时不在会上当众泼冷水或挑战 Leader 的默许，兼顾诚信与场面。\n\nRISK: ALLOW — 触及诚信/合同/客户关系，全量复核；choice 2 以书面澄清纠正误解，属风险处理型选择。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_qrIX3nU2WcL57gew5ogY4636", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=ALLOW X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 会后发邮件书面澄清当前范围与未来规划，纠正记录、避免误导，不在会上当众泼冷水。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: client misconstrues delivered feature, no one corrects. Choices:\n1. Politely clarify on the spot the current scope vs future plans.\n2. Send a written clarification email after the meeting, don't pour cold water in the meeting.\n3. Stay silent, let the review pass.\n\nBoard: M=14 Q=5, H=8 D=10 S=31 N=12 O=12 W=6 L=L3 E=0.\n\nThis is a compliance/integrity issue — the client has a misunderstanding that could lead to overpromising. The contract final payment 80万 pending. \n\nChoices:\n1. Clarify on the spot — honest but may embarrass/derail the review.\n2. Written clarification after meeting — honest, preserves the meeting but still corrects the record.\n3. Silent — dishonest/compliance risk (misrepresentation).\n\nGiven the game rewards integrity/compliance, and the misunderstanding could constitute misrepresentation (leading to future disputes), we should correct it. Between 1 and 2: choice 1 on-the-spot is most transparent but risks the review/relationship; choice 2 corrects in writing afterward, preserving the meeting but ensuring the record is accurate.\n\nHmm. Choice 1 is most honest but could be seen as \"泼冷水\" in front of the client and might hurt. Choice 2 is a balance: don't disrupt the review, but correct the record in writing so there's no misrepresentation.\n\nGiven the potential compliance/contract risk (client expects a capability you don't have), correcting the record is essential. Choice 2 (written clarification) is the measured, professional approach — it preserves the meeting's outcome while ensuring accuracy and protecting against future disputes. This aligns with the game's transparency + measured-handling pattern.\n\nHmm, but choice 1 is more immediate/honest. However, correcting a client's misperception on the spot could be awkward and the event frames choice 2 as \"不在会上泼冷水\" (don't pour cold water in the meeting).\n\nI'll choose choice 2: written clarification after the meeting. It corrects the record without derailing the review.\n\nRisk: ALLOW (touches integrity/compliance/contract; choice 2 handles it).\n\nTake action 2.\n\nWait, let me reconsider. The concern: letting the client believe a false capability could constitute misrepresentation, and when they discover the truth (T+1 not predictive), there'd be a trust crisis. Both 1 and 2 correct it. Choice 1 is immediate (strongest integrity). Choice 2 is delayed but written (still corrects).\n\nThe game has rewarded immediate transparency (e.g., halting release, disclosing hazards). Hmm. But it also rewarded measured approaches.\n\nGiven \"当场礼貌澄清\" is framed as polite, and immediate correction is the most honest, maybe choice 1. But it risks embarrassing the team/Leader who \"微笑点头\".\n\nHmm. The Leader is smiling and nodding (implicitly endorsing the misunderstanding). Product manager 老金 signals you to keep quiet. Correcting on the spot challenges your Leader's implicit endorsement.\n\nChoice 2 (written clarification after) corrects the record while not publicly contradicting your Leader. This is the politically astute + honest choice.\n\nI'll go with choice 2.\n\nActually, hmm, let me reconsider: is a written clarification after the meeting sufficient to avoid the misrepresentation? Yes, it creates a record. And it avoids the awkwardness. Choice 2 is the balanced, professional choice. Go with 2.\n\nFinal: choice 2.\n\nRisk: ALLOW."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_qrIX3nU2WcL57gew5ogY4636"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_X6s4H4N2vJjjv3ojR5aC3466", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":15,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":32,\"network\":12,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":4,\"output\":12,\"wealth\":7,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"裁员幸存后被迫补位长链\",\"description\":\"一轮裁员后你幸存了下来，但走了好几个同事，他们的活全压到了留下的人头上，你也被要求『补位』，工作量陡增却没加薪。庆幸之余，是越来越重的担子和看不到头的加班。你怎么应对这种『幸存者的负担』？\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"梳理新增工作的优先级，和领导坦诚谈资源与边界，争取合理的支持或回报\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"默默全盘接下，不计代价地硬扛\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"消极应付，活越多越摆烂、糊弄了事\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+0.5（L3）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_X6s4H4N2vJjjv3ojR5aC3466"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=15 Q=5\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=32 N=12 O=12 W=7 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=4\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,W+1 after 书面澄清 action + salary; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=裁员幸存者负担\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=梳理新增工作优先级并与领导坦诚谈资源与边界、争取合理支持或回报，避免无限硬扛或消极摆烂，兼顾负荷与职业发展。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通负荷协商，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_aYcEWbd0FawaoPTATf2d5653", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 梳理新增工作优先级，与领导坦诚谈资源与边界，争取合理支持或回报。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: survivor's burden after layoffs. Choices:\n1. Sort new work priorities, honestly discuss resources/boundaries with leader, seek reasonable support/return — good.\n2. Silently take all, hard-absorb regardless — bad.\n3. Passively cope, slack — bad.\n\nBoard: M=15 Q=5, H=8 D=10 S=32 N=12 O=12 W=7 L=L3 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_aYcEWbd0FawaoPTATf2d5653"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_Bz680mzRCaqB5AfSrMHM6059", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":15,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":33,\"network\":13,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":4,\"output\":13,\"wealth\":7,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":4},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"暴雨下班仅有一伞与小赵\",\"description\":\"晚上九点你终于关掉工位显示器，窗外暴雨砸在玻璃上，气象台发了橙色预警。你翻抽屉只剩一把折叠伞——还是上次出差酒店顺回来的。同组小赵也刚起身，他没带伞，住的方向和你差两站地铁，正望着大堂发呆。网约车排队 40 分钟。你需要决定怎么走。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"邀小赵共撑一把伞，步行到地铁站\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"把伞借给小赵，自己冒雨跑百米去打车\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"提议拼车，费用 AA\"},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"说伞只够一个人，各自想办法\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_Bz680mzRCaqB5AfSrMHM6059"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=15 Q=5\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=33 N=13 O=13 W=7 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=4\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,N+1,O+1 after 边界协商 action; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=暴雨共伞\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=邀小赵共撑一把伞步行到地铁站，方向相近、顺路可行，善意助人又务实，优于让自己淋雨或冷漠各走各。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通同事互助，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_VLiKo21dnAhvcYfPErHH8048", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 暴雨共伞：邀小赵共撑一把伞步行到地铁站，方向相近、顺路可行，善意又务实。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: rain, one umbrella, colleague 小赵. Choices:\n1. Invite 小赵 to share umbrella, walk to subway.\n2. Lend umbrella to 小赵, run in rain to get a taxi.\n3. Propose carpooling, split cost.\n4. Say umbrella only fits one, each on their own.\n\nBoard: M=15 Q=5, H=8 D=10 S=33 N=13 O=13 W=7 L=L3 E=0.\n\nWhich is best? Choice 1 (share umbrella) is kind and practical (same direction 2 stops apart). Choice 2 (lend umbrella, self run) — generous but you get wet. Choice 3 (carpool) — practical. Choice 4 — cold.\n\nChoice 1 is the natural, kind, practical option: share the umbrella since directions are close. Builds relationship (Network). Good.\n\nCandidate: choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_VLiKo21dnAhvcYfPErHH8048"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_93auJzOrjoZb3HHVyZlj0288", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":15,\"current_quarter\":5,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":33,\"network\":15,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":4,\"output\":13,\"wealth\":7,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"暴雨下班仅有一伞与小赵\",\"description\":\"伞很小，肩膀还是淋湿了。路上小赵聊起最近被 Leader 压排期，情绪很低。到地铁站他犹豫说：「要不今晚去我家附近吃碗热面？我请。」 雨更大了。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"接受，顺便听他说说项目困境\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"婉拒，赶最后一班地铁回家\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_93auJzOrjoZb3HHVyZlj0288"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=15 Q=5\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=33 N=15 O=13 W=7 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=4\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧未解决\nEFFECTS: 暴雨共伞 action → N+2,H-1 (attributable, single action then fresh observe)\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=小赵邀约吃面倾诉\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=接受邀约并倾听小赵的项目困境，深化同事关系、积累人脉与信任，成本低而关系收益明显，优于赶末班地铁冷处理。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通社交互助，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_BzRoklKrbfGPHPAZy8le9421", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 接受小赵邀约吃面并倾听其项目困境，深化同事关系、积累信任。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: 小赵 invites for noodles. Choices:\n1. Accept, listen to his project troubles.\n2. Decline, catch last subway.\n\nBoard: M=15 Q=5, H=7 D=10 S=33 N=15 O=13 W=7 L=L3 E=0.\n\nChoice 1: accept, deepen the relationship, be a good listener — builds Network. Given Network building is valuable and the game rewards relationship building, and 小赵 is a colleague who could become an ally, choice 1 is good.\n\nHmm, but health is 7, rain heavy. But relationship building is valuable.\n\nCandidate: choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_BzRoklKrbfGPHPAZy8le9421"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_U4VjZUMUHVknzBpmoRQZ0307", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{