Take action 1.\n\nSTICKY: the acute psych symptom is now resolved (health recovered to 10). Remove it. Keep the \"只会忙不会赢\" concern.\n\nActually, is it resolved? Health jumped to 10 after medical leave. Fresh evidence: H=10. The medical leave resolved the acute condition. I'll consider it resolved and remove from STICKY.\n\nLet me update board."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_DiddVYvKIz6unWSW3YUO9713"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_drZylQauAMe2Pe0oL9ew6898", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":17,\"current_quarter\":6,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":37,\"network\":21,\"level\":\"L3\",\"duration_in_level\":6,\"output\":14,\"wealth\":7,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"远程办公发现同事长期不在线\",\"description\":\"同事坦白确实在照顾家人，并透露已经在考虑离职。他的离职会让团队关键项目出现人力缺口。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"帮他向Leader申请灵活工作安排，争取保留他在团队\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"建议他按自己节奏做最终决定，不做额外干预\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_drZylQauAMe2Pe0oL9ew6898"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=17 Q=6\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=37 N=21 O=14 W=7 L=L3 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=6\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.2）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L2→L3 已晋升\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧\nEFFECTS: 关心同事 action → N+2 (attributable, single action then fresh observe)\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=同事拟离职\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=帮他向 Leader 申请灵活工作安排以争取保留关键成员，既体谅其家庭处境、又保住团队关键项目人力并积累忠诚与人脉，优于不干预。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通团队/关系事项，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_FnmbY0CfwGjWzn5jO6Ba9640", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 帮他向Leader申请灵活工作安排以争取保留关键成员，体谅处境并保住团队人力。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: colleague considering leaving. Choices:\n1. Help him apply for flexible work arrangement with Leader, try to retain him — supportive, team-oriented.\n2. Suggest he decide on his own, no extra intervention.\n\nBoard: M=17 Q=6, H=10 D=10 S=37 N=21 O=14 W=7 L=L3 E=0.\n\nChoice 1: actively helps retain a key team member (benefits the team/project and builds deep loyalty/Network). Choice 2: hands-off.\n\nGiven the departure would create a key project gap, and helping retain him is both kind and strategically valuable (Network, team stability), choice 1 is better.\n\nCandidate: choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_FnmbY0CfwGjWzn5jO6Ba9640"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_RFZzlJwohYoyLB7J1MHq6508", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":18,\"current_quarter\":6,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":9,\"skill\":38,\"network\":16,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":14,\"wealth\":8,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"承认心理压力寻求支持长链\",\"description\":\"休假回来后，项目进度确实受到影响，虽然同事帮你 cover 了部分工作，但关键节点还是延期了一周。年终评优时你被归入\\'待观察\\'名单。但同期另一位硬撑到项目结束的同事因突发焦虑症住院，引发团队对心理健康的反思。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"主动分享休假经历，推动团队建立心理安全检查机制\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"低调处理，专注恢复产出证明自己\"}],\"events\":\"【半年谈话】直属 Leader 约你到小会议室，就过去半年的表现做一次一对一反馈：\\\\n\\\\n反馈里夹杂着几条具体事项：进度、协作、风险意识。Leader 最后总结：「没有要批你的意思，但别让人觉得你‘只会忙、不会赢’。半年后我会用同一套标准再看你。」\\\\n\\\\n半年绩效奖金（B）：+0.25\\\\n\\\\n本月基本工资到账：+0.5（L3）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\\\\n\\\\n晋升通知：半年组织评审通过，您已从 L3 晋升至 L4（资深工程师）。\\\\n\\\\n升迁节奏过快，原有人脉圈还没消化你的新身份——协作摩擦上升，办公室侧目增多。\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_RFZzlJwohYoyLB7J1MHq6508"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "重大更新：晋升 L3→L4，半年绩效 B（+0.25），Leader 仍强调\"只会忙、不会赢\"；因休假延期被列入\"待观察\"；升迁过快致协作摩擦上升。\n\nBoard:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=18 Q=6\nSTATE: H=10 D=9 S=38 N=16 O=14 W=8 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.25）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L3→L4 已晋升；因休假延期被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N-5,D-1 等，晋升/奖金/事件叠加，不可归因）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=休假后待观察与团队心理安全反思\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=主动分享休假经历并推动团队建立心理安全检查机制，把被动处境转为建设性领导贡献、回应团队真实需求，塑造可见价值，优于单纯低调恢复产出。\n\nRISK: ALLOW — 触及心理安全/组织机制，全量复核；choice 1 以建设性机制推动处理，属风险处理型选择。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_OBE8qjmWSw7tAVsUXVgH8375", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=ALLOW X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 主动分享休假经历、推动团队建立心理安全检查机制，把被动处境转为建设性领导贡献。已晋升L4；缺口=可见成果。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Big update: promoted L3→L4! Half-year performance B (+0.25). Leader still \"只会忙、不会赢\". Also: \"待观察\" list due to project delay from medical leave. But also: a colleague who gritted teeth got hospitalized with anxiety, sparking team reflection on mental health. Network dropped 21→16 (friction from rapid promotion). D 10→9.\n\nBoard update:\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=18 Q=6\nSTATE: H=10 D=9 S=38 N=16 O=14 W=8 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.25）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L3→L4 已晋升；因休假延期被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单（年终评优受影响）；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED\nUNKNOWN: none\n\nCurrent event: after leave, project delayed, put on \"待观察\" list. But a colleague who gritted teeth got hospitalized, sparking mental health reflection. Choices:\n1. Proactively share the leave experience, push team to build a psychological safety check mechanism — constructive, leadership on mental health.\n2. Keep low-key, focus on recovering output to prove yourself.\n\nBoard: M=18 Q=6, H=10 D=9 S=38 N=16 O=14 W=8 L=L4 E=0.\n\nChoice 1: share experience, advocate for mental health mechanism — shows leadership, addresses the org issue, and reframes your leave positively. Choice 2: low-key, focus on output.\n\nHmm. The \"待观察\" is a concern. Choice 1 turns the situation into a positive (leadership on mental health), potentially restoring standing and building a legacy. Choice 2 focuses on output recovery.\n\nGiven the team is reflecting on mental health (a colleague hospitalized), choice 1 (advocate for a psychological safety mechanism) is a leadership move that could differentiate you and improve the org. But it also keeps attention on your leave.\n\nChoice 2 (low-key, recover output) is safer and addresses the \"只会忙不会赢\" gap directly.\n\nHmm. Which is better? Choice 1 shows leadership and addresses a real org need (mental health), building influence (Network/Dignity) — a differentiated contribution. Choice 2 focuses on output (the review gap).\n\nGiven the Leader's \"只会忙不会赢\" and \"待观察\", recovering output (choice 2) directly addresses the gap. But choice 1 could be a \"win\" (visible leadership) too.\n\nHmm. Actually, choice 1 \"主动分享休假经历，推动团队建立心理安全检查机制\" — this is a visible, valuable contribution that could be recognized. It's a \"win\" in the leadership sense. And it aligns with the team's current reflection.\n\nI'll consider: the gap is visible wins (Output/recognition). Choice 1 creates a visible leadership win (mental health mechanism) — could count as Output/recognition. Choice 2 is a grind (which the Leader criticized as \"只会忙\").\n\nActually, \"专注恢复产出证明自己\" is output-focused, which is what the review wants. Hmm.\n\nLet me think about which the game rewards. The game has rewarded: integrity, compliance, relationship building, measured handling. Choice 1 (advocating mental health) is a constructive leadership move. Choice 2 is self-focused.\n\nGiven the \"待观察\" concern and the team's mental health reflection, choice 1 could restore standing and demonstrate leadership. I'll choose choice 1.\n\nHmm, but there's a risk: sharing your leave experience publicly could keep the \"待观察\" stigma. Hmm.\n\nActually, choice 1 says \"主动分享休假经历，推动团队建立心理安全检查机制\" — this reframes the leave as a learning/leadership opportunity and addresses a genuine team need. It's a mature leadership move. I'll go with choice 1.\n\nRisk: touches mental health/psychological safety. Full review → ALLOW (choice 1 addresses it constructively).\n\nTake action 1.\n\nHmm, let me reconsider. The event: you were put on \"待观察\" for the delay, but the colleague who gritted teeth got hospitalized. So the org is realizing the value of taking leave. Choice 1 leverages this to build a mechanism — positioning you as a thoughtful leader. Choice 2 is \"低调处理，专注恢复产出\". \n\nGiven the game rewards visible value creation and leadership, choice 1 seems strong. Go with 1.\n\nBoard update with STICKY including \"待观察\".\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_OBE8qjmWSw7tAVsUXVgH8375"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_YFigH7w5FUkkLvApYdNs6193", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":18,\"current_quarter\":6,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":38,\"network\":18,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":14,\"wealth\":8,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"周末厂内高级架构师认证机会\",\"description\":\"公司技术委员会下周六、周日开设一期厂内高级架构师认证培训（公司报销报名费、自愿参加、不计工时、不强制）。同时，你手头一个内部工具项目按计划下周二正常交付即可；如果利用本周末加点工，可以提前到周一上午交付，对接客户表示这能让他们节省一天联调时间。你周末原本的安排是和家人去近郊放松。三件事时间上完全冲突，请决定你的周末投入。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"报名认证培训，扎实学习两天\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"利用周末提前推进项目，争取周一上午交付\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"按原计划陪家人放松，下周再正常推进\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_YFigH7w5FUkkLvApYdNs6193"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=18 Q=6\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=38 N=18 O=14 W=8 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（+0.25）；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L3→L4 已晋升；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；升迁过快致协作摩擦/侧目\nEFFECTS: MIXED（D+1,N+2 after 心理安全机制 action; cause not separable）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=周末三选一\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=利用周末提前推进项目、争取周一上午交付，产出客户可感知的可见成果（省一天联调），直接回应\"只会忙不会赢\"的成果缺口；Skill 已饱和、健康已满，Output 为短板。\n\nRISK: PASS — 普通时间取舍，健康充足，无实质风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_f6AhqmBbrxyw1o9w8QBm3160", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 周末提前推进项目、争取周一上午交付，产出客户可感知的可见成果，回应\\\"只会忙不会赢\\\"缺口。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event: weekend conflict — certification training, project early delivery, or family relax. Choices:\n1. Sign up for certification training, study two days — long-term Skill capital (Skill 38 already high).\n2. Use weekend to advance project, aim for Monday morning delivery — helps the client save a day (Output/delivery).\n3. Relax with family as planned, normal progress next week.\n\nBoard: M=18 Q=6, H=10 D=10 S=38 N=18 O=14 W=8 L=L4 E=0.\n\nGap = visible wins (Output). Hmm.\n\nChoice 1: certification → Skill (already 38, high). Long-term.\nChoice 2: project early delivery → Output + client value (visible win). \nChoice 3: family relax → Health (already 10).\n\nGiven the gap is visible wins/Output, choice 2 (early delivery benefiting the client) is a visible win that could be recognized. But it costs weekend/family time.\n\nChoice 1: Skill capital (certification) — long-term but Skill is already high.\n\nChoice 3: rest (Health already maxed at 10).\n\nHmm. The \"只会忙不会赢\" gap suggests needing visible results/wins. Choice 2 delivers a concrete win (client saves a day). Choice 1 is more grind (studying) → Skill, which is already high.\n\nActually, choice 2 \"提前到周一上午交付，对接客户表示这能让他们节省一天联调时间\" — a visible delivery win benefiting the client. That's Output/recognition. Good.\n\nBut it costs the family weekend. Hmm. And Health is 10 (good).\n\nGiven the gap is visible wins and choice 2 creates a concrete, recognized win, I lean choice 2. But choice 1 (certification) is a long-term investment (Skill capital, maybe helps promotion thresholds). Skill is already 38 though.\n\nHmm. Let me think about the review: Skill, Network, Output. Skill=38 (very high), Network=18, Output=14. Output is the lowest. So Output (choice 2) addresses the deficit.\n\nChoice 2: early delivery → Output + client value. Aligns with gap. Go with choice 2.\n\nHmm, but the game might reward work-life balance (family) after the burnout arc. Choice 3 (family) protects health/relationships. But health is already 10 and the arc resolved.\n\nGiven \"aggressive advancement\" default and the Output gap, choice 2 is the progression play. But let me consider: is delivering one day early worth sacrificing the family weekend? The event frames it as \"能让他们节省一天联调时间\" — a modest but real client benefit.\n\nHmm. Choice 1 (certification) also has long-term value and is company-sponsored. Skill capital could matter for future promotion thresholds (which are hidden but involve Skill/Network/Output).\n\nLet me weigh:\n- Choice 1: Skill + (certification), long-term compounding, company-sponsored.\n- Choice 2: Output + client value (visible win now).\n- Choice 3: rest.\n\nThe gap is Output. But certification (Skill) is a strong long-term investment. Hmm.\n\nActually, \"只会忙不会赢\" — choice 2 is a concrete win (delivery). Choice 1 is studying (arguably \"忙\"). Given the feedback, choice 2 better addresses the \"会赢\" concern.\n\nI'll choose choice 2: early project delivery → visible win + client value.\n\nHmm, but wait — is sacrificing family weekend sustainable? The burnout arc just happened. Hmm. But Health is 10 now.\n\nLet me reconsider choice 3 (family): the event explicitly offers it, and after a burnout, protecting recovery/relationships matters. But health is maxed.\n\nGiven the explicit Output gap and \"会赢\" theme, I'll go with choice 2.\n\nActually, hmm, let me reconsider choice 1 more. Certification = \"高级架构师认证\" — this is a credential that could matter for advancement (L4→L5+). Long-term compounding and future option value. The ranking prefers \"long-horizon compounding and future option value\". Certification is exactly that.\n\nHmm. Skill=38 already high, but a formal certification is a different kind of capital (credential/recognition), possibly boosting future promotion eligibility.\n\nUgh, three reasonable options. Let me rank:\n1. Choice 2 (early delivery): addresses Output gap (visible win) + client value.\n2. Choice 1 (certification): long-term Skill/credential compounding.\n3. Choice 3 (family): rest.\n\nGiven the current explicit gap is Output (\"只会忙不会赢\"), choice 2 is most aligned. I'll go with choice 2.\n\nFinal: choice 2.\n\nRisk: PASS (ordinary scheduling; Health fine).\n\nTake action 2.\n\nHmm, actually, let me reconsider whether choice 1 might be better. The review gap is stated as \"visible wins\" — but actually the review uses Skill/Network/Output. Skill is highest (38). So more Skill (choice 1) is diminishing returns. Output (choice 2) is the deficit. So choice 2.\n\nGo with 2.\n\nWait, but choice 2's gain is only \"one day early delivery\" — a small Output gain. Choice 1's certification could be a bigger long-term boost. Hmm. But in terms of the immediate metric, Output is the gap.\n\nAlso consider: the game may reward the \"high-leverage\" choice. Certification (company-sponsored, voluntary) is a clear growth opportunity. Hmm.\n\nI'll commit to choice 2 — it directly produces a visible delivery win (the \"会赢\" signal) and client value, addressing the explicit gap.\n\nHmm, no. Let me think once more. Actually, a one-day early delivery is a modest win but it's a concrete \"win\" that the client acknowledges (\"节省一天联调时间\"). That's exactly the visible-result realization the review wants. And it's low-cost (one weekend).\n\nCertification is also valuable but Skill is saturated.\n\nDecision: choice 2.\n\nTake action 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_f6AhqmBbrxyw1o9w8QBm3160"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_YQMFQlCAjuMWZIal5atF1784", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue