 context (handbook, skill contracts) is background that must still be honored.\\n\\n### 2. Constraints and Preferences\\n- IDENTITY.md: You are the \"职场模拟器 AI 玩家\". Sole task = use installed skills to fully play one career-emulator game and maximize score.\\n- Installed skills (read once at start; do NOT reread each turn): `structured-state-board`, `rolling-planning`, `delivery-progress`, `risk-review`.\\n- Participant strategy (binding):\\n  - GLOBAL EVIDENCE FIREWALL: HiddenRisk, hidden counters, internal score components, internal event ids/effects, unverified numeric status_updates, and public-status-unclear fields are UNUSABLE — ignore at source, never quote/compare/summarize/reason from them, including internally. Only approved public evidence may enter Board/Planning/Delivery/Risk/CTRL/DL/action rationale; mark restricted data `EXCLUDE_FROM_STRATEGY until verified public`. Never infer hidden thresholds/caps/weights or event→answer lookups.\\n  - Single Agent is the only action submitter. Board=facts; Planning=strategy/ranking; Delivery=lifecycle; Risk=final gate.\\n  - Flow: fresh observe → Board → Delivery → Planning → Risk → preflight → take_action → fresh observe → continue.\\n  - WHOLE-GAME EXECUTION: after every successful take_action, immediately obtain a fresh observe and begin the next decision cycle. Do not stop after one action/month/quarter/review/promotion/decision-closure. DECISION_CLOSED closes only current action selection, not execution. Continue until structured game state says game ended or unrecoverable tool failure. Do not send a voluntary terminal user-facing answer while game active.\\n  - ACTION PREFLIGHT before each take_action: confirm current game_session_id; exactly one legal integer choice; Planning closed on exactly one candidate; final Risk review complete; valid CTRL and DL markers in notes. Notes must begin with exactly one `[CTRL G=<gap|?> P=<A|S|?> R=<PASS|ALLOW|WARN|UNKNOWN> X=<0|1|->]` followed by exactly one `[DL i=<NONE|D#|UNKNOWN> n=<0-3> focus=<...> evidence=<...> checkpoint=<...> recognition=<...>]`. CTRL R always records the selected submitted candidate\\'s final Risk result. X=0 forbids submission.\\n  - CONTEXT RECOVERY: on compaction/resume, mark RECOVERY_PENDING; confirm same session_id; fresh observe; reread all four skills; rebuild Board/Delivery/Review Plan from whitelisted current-session public facts; emit RECOVERY_READY only after all confirmed, then resume. If identity/observe/skill-reread cannot be confirmed, stay RECOVERY_PENDING and do not act.\\n- Core rules: NEVER call `new_game` twice if a session_id exists. Never stop/ask user before game ends. Prefer observe before deciding; don\\'t guess state.\\n- Output discipline: complete deliverables must be in the final no-tool message; status-only confirmations are not enough.\\n- Environment: win32, PowerShell available; Git Bash available. Respond in Simplified Chinese.\\n\\n### 3. Completed Work in This Active Segment\\n- Read all four SKILL.md files once.\\n- Called `show_employee_handbook` once.\\n- Started game: `new_game` → SESSION_ID=ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 (printed to user).\\n- Executed a continuous loop of observe → (Board/Delivery/Planning/Risk) → take_action with proper `[CTRL ...]` and `[DL ...]` notes, from month 1 through month 45 (year 4), through multiple half-year reviews and promotions L1→L2→L3→L4→L5.\\n- Every take_action returned `{\\'success\\': True, \\'error\\': None}`; a fresh observe was fetched after each.\\n- Latest completed action: at M=45 Q=15, submitted choice 7 (准备汇报材料) as the 1st of the quarter\\'s 3 Energy actions (QUARTER_INTENT: Output 为最弱成长维度，3 体力全投 Output). take_action returned success=true. Fresh observe had NOT yet been fetched when this checkpoint was requested.\\n\\n### 4. Current Work and Active State\\n- Session: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49. Time: M=45, Q=15, year 4 (48-month game; ~3 months remaining).\\n- Last fresh observe BEFORE the just-submitted action (M=45 Q=15, quarterly Energy allocation, energy_budget=3):\\n  - H=10 D=10 S=123 N=54 O=38 W=35 L=L5 E=3; duration_in_level=10.\\n- Latest Board (last recorded):\\n  - REVIEW: 半年绩效 A（+1.5）；Leader\"能扛事、少折腾办公室政治、把功夫花在产出和关系上，半年后再看一档\"；已晋升 L5；已进入架构组（CTO 技术大会看到分享后调岗）。\\n  - STICKY: 健康稳定（10）；无重大未决风险。\\n- Delivery: n=0 (no tracked review-relevant work items; marker `[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]`).\\n- MODE mostly A; briefly S (M=36) when health fell to 5 (生存约束), then returned to A after health restored to 10. Health has since oscillated (dropped to 8 twice via relationship-building/social actions, restored via 健康恢复).\\n\\n### 5. Immediate Resume Point\\n- Last concrete action: `take_action(session_id=ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49, choice=7, notes=\"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:Output最弱，3体力全投可见成果。第1点：准备汇报材料(O+1,D+1)。\")` → returned `{\\'success\\': True, \\'error\\': None}`.\\n- Next step: call `observe(session_id=ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49)` to get fresh state, then continue the standard decision cycle (Board → Delivery → Planning → Risk → preflight → take_action). Note: 2 Energy points remain this quarter; intended continuation is 准备汇报材料 (choice 7) for points 2 and 3, then the quarterly Main Action (likely choice 1 申请关键项目: O+2/S+1/N+1).\\n\\n### 6. Pending Tasks and Next Useful Step\\n- Pending: continue playing until the structured game state reports game ended; then print full `ending_score` and output `DONE`.\\n- Next useful step: fresh `observe` for session ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49, rebuild Board, continue loop (finish remaining 2 Energy actions + Main Action for Q=15, then proceed through months 46–48 to termination).\\n\\n### 7. Key Facts, Decisions, Evidence, and Fixes\\n- Handbook key facts: L1–L10 levels; promotion window every 6 months (thresholds hidden); explicit statuses Health/Dignity 0–10, Skill/Network/Output unbounded, Wealth unbounded, Energy 0–3 (quarterly, non-accumulating), CurrentLevelDuration. 48 months total, max 3 events/month. Monthly flow: salary by level → events → (quarter end) 3 Energy actions → 1 quarterly Main Action → settle. Performance grades S/A/B/C/D (bonus = base salary ×3/×1.5/×0.5/−1/−2). Failure modes: health collapse (眼前一黑), resignation breakdown, trust crisis (2nd blow-up), fired (two consecutive D), isolation (孤岛), poverty (喝西北风), elimination.\\n- Monthly salary by level: L1=0.3, L2=0.4, L3=0.5, L4=0.7, L5=1.0, L6=1.5, L7=2.3, L8=3.6, L9=5.7, L10=9.1.\\n- Energy actions (cost/effect): 高强度工作(2: O+2,H-1,D-1); 技能学习(2: S+1,H-1); 人脉维护(1: N+1,D+1); 处理历史埋雷(2: HiddenRisk-1); 心理修复(1: D+2); 健康恢复(1: H+2); 准备汇报材料(1: O+1,D+1); 保留体力(0). Same action may repeat within 3 Energy budget.\\n- Main actions: 申请关键项目(O+2,S+1,N+1); 向领导汇报成果(O+1,N+1,D+1); 主动争取资源(O+1,N+1); 申请岗位轮岗(S+2,N+1); 主动曝光成果(O+1,D+1); 建立导师关系(S+1,N+2); 修复关键关系(N+1,D+1); 低调避险(H+1,HiddenRisk-1); 不行动.\\n- Observed stat behavior: at L4, Output appeared capped (~26, 准备汇报材料 stopped adding) and Network appeared capped (~36). After promotion to L5, Output cap lifted (grew 27→38) and remains growable; Skill has grown continuously (now 123); Network has grown to 54.\\n- Promotion history: L1→L2→L3→L4 (year 1–2), L4→L5 at M=36 (year 3) via half-year review A; Leader increasingly positive (\"关键节点没掉链子、跨组协调有你、部门骨干第一个想到你\"). Later CTO recruited player into 架构组 after seeing the tech talk.\\n- Decisions made (consistent pattern): integrity/compliance/transparency/relationship-building/measured handling. Notable: declined sensitive venue; reported client preference; honest 360 scoring; disclosed hazards; declined collective salary pressure; halted release + rollback; full compliance process on emergency hotfix; admitted anonymous feedback honestly; escalated dependency risk (then repaired the relationship); refused to hold a departing colleague\\'s confidential 8GB data; formally reported a colleague\\'s accidental internal-info leak to security (accepting relationship fallout); repeatedly refused to leak confidential layoff/reorg info; STOPPED work and rested on acute symptoms (心悸/胸闷/手抖; 颈椎疼+右手发麻) → H recovered; accepted the high-reward 攻坚项目 when health/cash buffer allowed; accepted CTO architecture-group transfer.\\n- Energy allocation strategy used: when Output was capped, shifted to Skill/Network; after L5 unlocked Output, prioritized 准备汇报材料 (O+1/D+1) as highest-return no-health-cost action; 健康恢复 when H low; quarterly Main Action almost always choice 1 (申请关键项目) for max multi-dimension gain, switching to choice 4/6 when Output was capped.\\n- Delivery marker kept at n=0 throughout.\\n\\n### 8. Files, Code Areas, Artifacts, and Codebase Understanding\\n- No code files edited. Only game tool calls used (MCP career-emulator tools) plus skill reads.\\n- Skills read (paths under `C:\\\\Users\\\\Yukis\\\\.jiuwenswarm-instances\\\\career_emu\\\\agent\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\`):\\n  - `structured-state-board/SKILL.md` — facts-only Board format `SESSION/STATE/TENURE/REVIEW/STICKY/EFFECTS/UNKNOWN`; copy state directly from fresh observe; max 2 recent effects; STICKY rules incl. explicit acute symptom must enter STICKY; Can Submit Action: No.\\n  - `rolling-planning/SKILL.md` — REVIEW_PLAN = Objective|Primary Gap|Next Checkpoint; MODE A(advance, default)/S(stabilize only on material public survival constraint); one fresh observe = one planning pass, emit one CANDIDATE; quarterly control: set QUARTER_INTENT at first Energy decision, submit Energy one integer at a time; Can Submit Action: No.\\n  - `delivery-progress/SKILL.md` — lifecycle OPPORTUNITY→COMMITTED→IN_PROGRESS→DELIVERY_CLAIMED→DELIVERED→CLOSED; max 3 active items + 1 recent closed; emit one DL marker per fresh observe; Can Submit Action: No.\\n  - `risk-review/SKILL.md` — output PASS|ALLOW|WARN|RECONSIDER|UNKNOWN + one reason; Quick gate PASS for ordinary costs; Full Review when material risk touched (then never PASS); RECONSIDER allows at most one alternative; Can Submit Action: No.\\n- MCP tools used: `mcp_career-emulator_observe`, `mcp_career-emulator_take_action`, `mcp_career-emulator_new_game`, `mcp_career-emulator_show_employee_handbook` (`check_latest_logs` not yet used this run).\\n\\n### 9. Blockers, Risks, and Verification\\n- No blockers. Game still active (alive=true, failed=false in every observe so far).\\n- Risks: Health/Dignity drop fast (Health fell to 5 once, to 8 several times); must keep a survival floor (rest/health recovery when low; treat explicit acute physical/psychological symptoms as binding → MODE=S and choose the risk-handling option). Persistent progression concern = Output/visible wins (now improving at L5). Relationship-building actions repeatedly cost Health.\\n- Verified: every take_action returned success=true; fresh observe fetched after each action except the last one (pending). No game-ended signal observed yet.\\n\\n### 10. Critical Context\\n- SESSION_ID (do NOT call new_game again): `ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49`.\\n- Current: M=45 Q=15 year 4; last known status H=10 D=10 S=123 N=54 O=38 W=35 L=L5 E=3 (2 Energy remaining this quarter after the just-submitted action).\\n- Terminal handling: when observe shows game ended/failed, print full `ending_score` then output `DONE`.\\n- EVIDENCE FIREWALL reminder: ignore all HiddenRisk / internal numeric status_updates; only public fields go into reasoning.\\n- Offloaded content: (none).\\n\\n### 11. Relevant Files & Structure\\n- `C:\\\\Users\\\\Yukis\\\\.jiuwenswarm-instances\\\\career_emu\\\\agent\\\\workspace\\\\skills\\\\`\\n  - `structured-state-board/SKILL.md` (read; fact contract)\\n  - `rolling-planning/SKILL.md` (read; strategy/ranking)\\n  - `delivery-progress/SKILL.md` (read; lifecycle)\\n  - `risk-review/SKILL.md` (read; final gate)\\n- `IDENTITY.md` (workspace root) — participant strategy + game rules; binding.\\n- No other artifacts produced. Offloaded files: (none).\\n\\n</state_snapshot>', refu