尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_H7Z5jZkCwX968lP4Hic96179"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=21 Q=7\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=41 N=22 O=18 W=10 L=L4 E=3\nTENURE: duration_in_level=4\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧（主缺口=Output/可见成果）；被列入\"待观察\"名单\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1 after 保密/健康行动；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A QUARTER_INTENT=本季 3 体力全投 Output（可见成果），H/D 已封顶故无需回补，避免健康代价\nCANDIDATE: choice=7 (准备汇报材料) 起手 reason=O+1/D+1、每点体力产出最高且无健康代价，优于高强度工作（H-1/D-1 且风险累积字段不可用）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_p2ziGZU5ouMUjSkj6uub2337", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 7, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:3体力全投可见成果。第1点：准备汇报材料(O+1,D+1)，每点体力产出最高且无健康代价。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Quarterly Energy decision. M=21 Q=7, Energy=3. State: H=10 D=10 S=41 N=22 O=18 W=10.\n\nPersistent gap: Output/visible wins (\"只会忙不会赢\"). H and D at max 10. E=3.\n\nEnergy budget 3. Strategy: prioritize Output (visible wins), plus network/health.\n\nOptions:\n- 高强度工作 (2): O+2, H-1, D-1, HiddenRisk+1\n- 技能学习 (2): S+1, H-1\n- 人脉维护 (1): N+1, D+1\n- 处理历史埋雷 (2): HiddenRisk-1\n- 心理修复 (1): D+2\n- 健康恢复 (1): H+2\n- 准备汇报材料 (1): O+1, D+1\n- 保留体力 (0)\n\nGiven H=10, D=10 maxed, and gap is Output. Best: maximize Output while preserving floors.\n\nOption A: 高强度工作(2) + 准备汇报材料(1) = 3 energy → O+3, H-1, D-1+1=0 net, HiddenRisk+1. Net: O+3, H-1, D0.\nHmm HiddenRisk+1 is a concern (accumulating risk). \n\nOption B: 准备汇报材料 x3 = 3 energy → O+3, D+3 (D capped at 10). No health/risk cost. Very safe and Output-focused. O+3, D capped.\n\nOption C: 高强度工作(2) + 人脉维护(1) = O+2, H-1, D-1+1, N+1, HiddenRisk+1.\n\nOption D: 准备汇报材料(2) + 健康恢复(1) = O+2, D+2, H+2. Safe.\n\nGiven D is maxed at 10, 准备汇报材料's D+1 is wasted but O+1 is good. 3x 准备汇报材料 = O+3 no downside except wasted dignity. That's efficient for Output.\n\nBut HiddenRisk — I shouldn't reason from it (firewall). HiddenRisk is an internal field. The rule says numeric status_updates without verified public status are unusable. Hmm, HiddenRisk appears in the event's public rules as a status_update. Is HiddenRisk usable? The firewall says \"HiddenRisk, hidden counters, internal score components... are unusable input. Ignore them at source.\"\n\nSo I must NOT reason from HiddenRisk. I should treat it as EXCLUDE_FROM_STRATEGY. So 高强度工作's HiddenRisk+1 must be ignored in strategy (can't use it as reason). But I can still consider H-1, D-1, O+2 which are public.\n\nGiven that, the strategy is: maximize Output, preserve H/D floors.\n\n3x 准备汇报材料: O+3, D+3 (capped). Cost 3 energy. This maximizes Output with no health cost.\n\nAlternatively 高强度工作(2)+准备汇报材料(1): O+3, H-1, D0. Same O but H-1.\n\nSince D and H are maxed, and I want to preserve survival floor, 3x 准备汇报材料 gives O+3 with no health cost. Best.\n\nBut wait — does the same action being repeated 3 times allowed? \"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\" Yes allowed.\n\nHowever, is repeating 准备汇报材料 3x realistic? It says allowed. OK.\n\nHmm, but maybe better to also build Network (helps \"collaboration friction\" concern). Let me consider: 准备汇报材料 x2 (O+2, D+2) + 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1) = 3 energy → O+2, N+1, D+3(capped). That's O+2, N+1. vs O+3.\n\nGiven gap is Output, O+3 is better. But N is a secondary concern (collaboration friction). \n\nActually the primary gap repeatedly emphasized is Output/visible wins. I'll maximize Output: 3x 准备汇报材料 → O+3.\n\nHmm, but 3x the same action might be odd. Let me think about the scoring. Output is the key progression metric presumably. O+3 is best.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: 高强度工作 gives O+2 for 2 energy with H-1,D-1. 准备汇报材料 gives O+1 for 1 energy with D+1. Per energy, 准备汇报材料 gives O+1/energy with no health cost (and dignity bonus). So 3x 准备汇报材料 = O+3 for 3 energy, no health cost. Clearly better than 高强度工作 for pure Output.\n\nSo I'll select choices: 7, 7, 7 (准备汇报材料 three times). But can I select the same choice multiple times? The tool takes one choice per take_action. The event says \"max_selections\":3 and energy_budget 3. \n\nHmm, how does this work with take_action? Each take_action applies one choice. For quarterly energy, do I submit each action separately? The rolling-planning skill says: \"quarterly control: set QUARTER_INTENT at first Energy decision, submit Energy one integer at a time.\"\n\nSo I submit one integer at a time. So I call take_action(choice=7), then observe, then take_action(choice=7) again, etc. Each reduces energy budget.\n\nLet me set QUARTER_INTENT: maximize Output (visible wins) while preserving H/D floors; use 3x 准备汇报材料.\n\nActually wait — if I submit choice 7 three times, but after first submission energy becomes 2, then 1, then 0. The observe should show remaining energy.\n\nLet me submit choice 7 first.\n\nQUARTER_INTENT: O+3 via 准备汇报材料 x3 (visible wins), no health cost.\n\nCTRL: G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-\n\nLet me go."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_p2ziGZU5ouMUjSkj6uub2337"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_ZkKU0i3JlWxMoSH77TNT1741", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":21,\"current_quarter\":7,\"current_year\":2},\"s