打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_sw82YCS1yhKRIoA4ui4G5542"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_LcPRdm4Iw7hEty2NYRQ42327", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 7, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:3体力全投可见成果。第3点：准备汇报材料(O+1,D+1)，产出最大化且无健康代价。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Energy now 1. O=20. Submit third energy: choice 7 again."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_LcPRdm4Iw7hEty2NYRQ42327"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_haNALpjDcXYj7xpqMVWa7544", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_mo