\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_haNALpjDcXYj7xpqMVWa7544"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=21 Q=7\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=41 N=22 O=21 W=10 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=4\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧（主缺口=Output/可见成果，本季已投 3 点体力补强）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（O+3 after 准备汇报材料x3；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A QUARTER_INTENT=主行动取多维度增益最大化\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 (申请关键项目) reason=O+2/S+1/N+1 三维同步增益最大，直击 Output 主缺口并拓展能力与人脉，优于其他单项行动。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本主行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_NqmN8TOTQ0FXHHRF9QFz3770", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 季度主行动取申请关键项目(O+2,S+1,N+1)，三维同步增益最大，直击Output主缺口。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Quarterly Main Action. State: H=10 D=10 S=41 N=22 O=21 W=10 L=L4 E=0.\n\nPersistent gap: Output/visible wins. Best main action for multi-dimension: choice 1 申请关键项目 (O+2, S+1, N+1). That's the max gain. Given gap is Output, choice 1 gives O+2 plus S+1,N+1.\n\nCandidate: choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_NqmN8TOTQ0FXHHRF9QFz3770"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_6kdhh7THaOlKtg4By7k36484", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":22,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":42,\"network\":23,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":5,\"output\":23,\"wealth\":10,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"年会节目排练严重占用个人时间长链\",\"description\":\"部门要在年会上出一个集体舞台节目，组织者排了密集的晚间排练，几乎每个工作日下班后都要留一两个小时，持续两周。你本职工作正忙、个人计划也被打乱，但这是部门集体活动，大家都在参与，领导也很重视。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"积极参与，同时和组织者协调出更高效的排练节奏、兼顾本职\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"全勤陪练，本职工作堆着不管\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"频繁请假缺席，觉得『跳舞耽误正事』\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+0.7（L4）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR皱着眉头跟你说，你积攒了不少风险，自己好好处理好。\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_6kdhh7THaOlKtg4By7k36484"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=22 Q=8\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=42 N=23 O=23 W=10 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=5\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 口头提醒\"积攒了不少风险，要自己处理好\"（公开叙事信号）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（O+2,S+1,N+1 after 季度主行动申请关键项目）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=年会排练平衡\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=积极参与同时协调更高效节奏、兼顾本职，兼顾集体关系与个人产出，优于全勤陪练（荒废本职）或频繁缺席（得罪团队）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本选择。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_f5FoR1gDWxAcGyFqvuy30340", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 积极参与年会节目同时协调更高效排练节奏、兼顾本职，平衡集体关系与个人产出。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "New event M=22 Q=8: 年会节目排练占用个人时间. Choices:\n1. 积极参与，同时和组织者协调更高效的排练节奏、兼顾本职 — balanced, handles both.\n2. 全勤陪练，本职工作堆着不管 — neglects work.\n3. 频繁请假缺席，觉得跳舞耽误正事 — alienates team.\n\nChoice 1 is best: participates in team activity (network/dignity) while protecting work output and personal time.\n\nBoard: H=10 D=10 S=42 N=23 O=23 W=10 L=L4 E=0. duration_in_level=5.\n\nNote the event text mentions \"你积攒了不少风险\" — HiddenRisk. That's a firewall field — ignore for strategy, but it hints there may be accumulation. I can't reason from it numerically. But I could consider 处理历史埋雷 or 低调避险 if public. Actually the \"风险\" mention is a public-ish narrative but the numeric HiddenRisk is firewalled. I'll keep it in UNKNOWN/STICKY as a public signal (\"HR提醒风险累积\" is a public statement). Hmm, the firewall says \"HiddenRisk, hidden counters... are unusable input.\" The HR statement \"你积攒了不少风险\" is a public narrative statement, not a numeric status_update. I think it's a legitimate public signal (an NPC tells me). I can note it as a public signal but not quantify. Actually to be safe, I'll treat it as a public narrative concern in STICKY but not reason from HiddenRisk numbers.\n\nActually the strategy says only approved public evidence. An NPC's in-game statement is public. I'll note it. But I shouldn't use it to infer hidden thresholds. Fine.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_f5FoR1gDWxAcGyFqvuy30340"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_CVcuDQeEejfmzrkJe6TD4264", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":22,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":9,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":43,\"network\":25,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":5,\"output\":23,\"wealth\":10,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"汇报前十分钟发现领导数据口径问题\",\"description\":\"部门季度经营分析会还有 10 分钟开始。你刚核对完「星云增长」看板，发现 Leader 幻灯片第 7 页引用的「月活环比 +38%」把试用账号和正式付费用户混在一起统计，而对外口径应只看付费 MAU——按正确口径只有 +12%。这组数字是汇报亮点。Leader 正在和 VP 寒暄，问你「材料没问题吧」。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"立刻低声提醒 Leader 口径差异，建议现场改口径\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"会后私下发邮件说明，不在会前打断\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"装作不知，让汇报顺利进行\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_CVcuDQeEejfmzrkJe6TD4264"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=22 Q=8\nSTATE: H=9 D=10 S=43 N=25 O=23 W=10 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=5\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 口头提醒\"积攒了不少风险\"\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,N+2,H-1 after 年会排练平衡；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=汇报口径纠错\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=立刻低声提醒 Leader 口径差异并建议现场改口径，坚守数据诚信、避免对外口径错误，优于会后才说（错过纠错窗口）或装作不知（诚信/合规风险）。\n\nRISK: ALLOW — 触及诚信/合规与 Leader 关系，全量复核；choice 1 为诚实且及时的纠错路径。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_7MM0cs56RyLyh3oBRVXz0978", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=ALLOW X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 立刻低声提醒Leader口径差异并建议现场改口径，坚守数据诚信、避免对外口径错误。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=22: 汇报前十分钟发现领导数据口径问题. Choices:\n1. 立刻低声提醒 Leader 口径差异，建议现场改口径 — integrity, immediate correction.\n2. 会后私下发邮件说明，不在会前打断 — delayed, but risk of presenting wrong data.\n3. 装作不知 — dishonest, compliance risk.\n\nChoice 1 is the honest, timely, integrity-preserving option. Given the meeting is in 10 min and this is a data accuracy/compliance issue, immediate low-key reminder is best.\n\nBoard: H=9 D=10 S=43 N=25 O=23 W=10 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS (or ALLOW since integrity/compliance). This touches compliance/trust. I'll do full-ish review → ALLOW. Actually it's a choice where the recommended path is honest. Quick PASS is fine for ordinary costs; this touches compliance but the choice is the compliant one. Let me use ALLOW to be safe (material compliance touched → never PASS). Actually risk-review: \"Full Review when material risk touched (then never PASS)\". This touches compliance/trust materially. So R=ALLOW.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_7MM0cs56RyLyh3oBRVXz0978"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_RJ1rkqwk3OwgNt2PMht48912", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":22,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":9,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":44,\"network\":25,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":5,\"output\":23,\"wealth\":10,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"汇报前十分钟发现领导数据口径问题\",\"description\":\"Leader 脸色微变，删掉该页改为 +12%，VP 追问「怎么比上周宣传的低」。Leader 会后说：「下次提前一天核对。」\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"主动承担会后向 VP 补充说明统计口径\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"不再提此事，避免 Leader 难堪\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_RJ1rkqwk3OwgNt2PMht48912"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=22 Q=8\nSTATE: H=9 D=10 S=44 N=25 O=23 W=10 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=5\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"积攒了不少风险\"\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1 after 口径纠错；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=口径问题善后\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=主动承担会后向 VP 补充说明统计口径，保持透明与专业、维护组织数据可信度，优于不再提（留下对外口径疑问）。\n\nRISK: ALLOW — 触及 Leader 关系/组织合规，全量复核；choice 1 为透明负责的善后路径。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_5BlQROwfo1SmTMtHLMLQ4828", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=ALLOW X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 主动承担会后向VP补充说明统计口径，保持透明专业、维护组织数据可信度。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Follow-up event. Leader said \"下次提前一天核对\". Choices:\n1. 主动承担会后向 VP 补充说明统计口径 — proactive, transparent, integrity.\n2. 不再提此事，避免 Leader 难堪 — avoid.\n\nChoice 1 is transparent and reinforces integrity, but could annoy Leader. However it's the honest/compliance-forward option. Given the pattern of integrity choices and that explaining the correct 口径 to VP is the right thing (VP already questioned), choice 1 is best.\n\nActually, VP already asked \"怎么比上周宣传的低\". Providing a supplementary explanation clarifies. Choice 1 maintains transparency and protects credibility.\n\nBoard: H=9 D=10 S=44 N=25 O=23 W=10 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: ALLOW (touches Leader relationship/compliance). Actually let me consider — could choice 1 upset the Leader more? The Leader already said \"下次提前一天核对\" (mild). Proactively explaining 口径 to VP is defensible and transparent. I'll pick choice 1.\n\nRisk: ALLOW.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_5BlQROwfo1SmTMtHLMLQ4828"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_dwnwWuK98aDDVZJZ81ie3725", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":23,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":46,\"network\":26,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":6,\"output\":23,\"wealth\":11,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"年会节目排练严重占用个人时间长链\",\"description\":\"你提议把排练改成『分组练+合练』，效率高了不少，大家也不用每天耗到很晚，组织者很感激。临近年会，组织者因家里有事顶不住了，问你能不能接手把最后的彩排和上台统筹起来。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"顶上来把彩排和上台流程统筹好，让节目顺利亮相\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"婉拒，『我帮着练可以，统筹就算了』\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+0.7（L4）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR皱着眉头跟你说，你积攒了不少风险，自己好好处理好。\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_dwnwWuK98aDDVZJZ81ie3725"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=23 Q=8\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=46 N=26 O=23 W=11 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=6\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"积攒了不少风险\"；健康下行（10→8）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2,N+1,H-1 after 口径善后；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=年会统筹请求\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=顶上来统筹彩排与上台，抓住可见的领导力展示机会、巩固团队关系，直击\"只会忙不会赢\"与协作摩擦关切，优于婉拒（错失可见度且伤组织者关系）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规团队行动；健康 8 未触及生存红线。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_5ix6hwYxVyHz8kwaerSK7587", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 顶上来统筹彩排与上台流程，抓住可见领导力展示机会、巩固团队关系，直击可见成果与协作摩擦关切。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=23: 组织者请你接手年会彩排和上台统筹. Choices:\n1. 顶上来把彩排和上台流程统筹好 — step up, leadership/network gain, but consumes time/energy (health cost?).\n2. 婉拒 — protect self.\n\nH is 8 (dropping). Let me think. Given H=8 (dropped from 10), and continued risks. But choice 1 offers visible leadership (network/dignity) — helps \"visible win\" gap. However it's extra load while H declining.\n\nHmm. The strategy: aggressive advancement. But health at 8. This is a leadership opportunity that's visible. Choice 1 could give Network/Dignity. But might cost Health.\n\nGiven H=8 and the recurring health warnings, I should be cautious. But choice 1 is a chance to be a visible leader (addresses \"只会忙不会赢\" and \"collaboration friction\" concerns). \n\nLet me weigh: H=8 is not critical yet (floor ~0, failure at collapse). Actually I don't know the exact failure threshold. Health 0-10. 8 is still healthy-ish. The event earlier warned about overwork. \n\nI think choice 1 is fine — stepping up builds network/leadership and is the team-player move. But it might reduce health. Given H=8, maybe safer to decline? But declining could hurt relationships.\n\nActually the event framing: organizer is grateful, asks for help. Stepping up is the \"visible leadership\" move that addresses the recurring concern. I'll pick choice 1.\n\nRisk: PASS (ordinary, though slight health consideration). Hmm, given H=8, and history of health issues, let me consider MODE. Is there a material public survival constraint? H=8 isn't critical. MODE=A. \n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. Health is at 8 and has been declining (10→9→8). The recurring pattern of health warnings suggests I should protect health. But choice 1's cost is unknown (could be health -1 or none). Given the gap is visible wins, and this is a visible leadership role, choice 1 aligns.\n\nI'll go with choice 1.\n\nBoard: M=23 Q=8, H=8 D=10 S=46 N=26 O=23 W=11 L=L4 E=0, duration_in_level=6."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_5ix6hwYxVyHz8kwaerSK7587"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_dn1kNy2a3qV9Lqf8OdNP5831", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":23,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":48,\"network\":28,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":6,\"output\":24,\"wealth\":11,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"新模块的技术栈选型抉择\",\"description\":\"你要为一个新模块做技术选型。团队现有的成熟技术栈你闭眼都能写、交付确定性高；行业里有一个更现代的框架，社区活跃、长期看更契合技术演进方向，但你和组里都没有生产经验，引入要踩坑、首期交付存在不确定性。好在这个模块不在关键路径上，时间相对宽裕，Leader 把决定权完全交给了你。下周的架构小结上要给出方案。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"引入新框架，借这个低风险模块积累新技术经验\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"沿用成熟技术栈，优先保证交付确定性\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_dn1kNy2a3qV9Lqf8OdNP5831"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=23 Q=8\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=48 N=28 O=24 W=11 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=6\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧（主缺口=Output）；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"积攒了不少风险\"；健康持续下行（10→7）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2,N+2,O+1,H-1 after 年会统筹；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=技术栈选型\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=沿用成熟栈优先保证交付确定性，直击 Output 主缺口（Skill 已高达 48、边际收益低），优于引入新框架（首期交付不确定、Skill 增益有限）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规技术决策，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_O4REst4oN7vwzAXYKPQA0177", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 沿用成熟技术栈优先保证交付确定性，直击Output主缺口（Skill已高、边际收益低）。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=23: 技术栈选型. Choices:\n1. 引入新框架，借低风险模块积累新技术经验 — skill growth, longer-term.\n2. 沿用成熟技术栈，优先保证交付确定性 — delivery certainty.\n\nGiven the gap is Output/visible wins and Skill is already high (48), and this is a low-risk module with time, choice 1 builds Skill + modern experience. But choice 2 guarantees delivery certainty (Output). Hmm.\n\nSkill is already the highest stat (48). Output is the gap. Choice 2 protects delivery certainty → Output. But choice 1 gives Skill (which is already high) and modern experience.\n\nActually, this is a low-risk module off the critical path. Choice 1 = growth/learning, aligns with long-term career capital. But given Output gap, choice 2 = certainty.\n\nHmm. Skill 48 is already strong. Output 24. The gap is Output. But choice 1 could give Skill + maybe recognition for technical leadership. Choice 2 gives Output certainty.\n\nLet me think about which scores better. The persistent Leader concern is \"只会忙不会赢\" = Output/visible wins. So maximizing Output matters. Choice 2 ensures delivery certainty → likely Output gain.\n\nBut choice 1 on a low-risk module = Skill + modern tech. Skill is already high; diminishing.\n\nActually the framing \"这个模块不在关键路径上，时间相对宽裕\" suggests it's a safe place to try new tech (learning opportunity). Choice 1 = invest in future capability. Given career advancement long-term, Skill+modern experience could help reach higher levels.\n\nHmm, this is a genuine tradeoff. Given the recurring emphasis on Output/visible wins and that Skill is already the top stat, I'll lean... Actually, let me think about the game mechanics. Skill and Output both contribute to promotion presumably. Output gap is the stated concern. But choice 2's benefit is \"交付确定性\" which may just avoid risk, not add Output.\n\nChoice 1 with \"积累新技术经验\" → Skill+. Given Skill is high, marginal. But also \"长期看更契合技术演进方向\" → future value.\n\nI think for maximizing career, a low-risk chance to modernize skills is good, and the module is explicitly low-risk with time. I'll pick choice 1.\n\nHmm, but wait — \"引入要踩坑、首期交付存在不确定性\". If it causes delivery issues, could hurt. But it's off critical path. \n\nLet me decide: The gap is Output. Choice 2 = delivery certainty (safe). Choice 1 = Skill (already high). Given Skill 48 is dominant and Output 24 lags, and Leader wants visible wins... Actually choice 2 doesn't necessarily add Output either; it just avoids uncertainty.\n\nI'll go with choice 1 — it's a low-risk growth opportunity, builds Skill and modern experience which supports long-term advancement to higher levels. The module is off the critical path so delivery risk is contained.\n\nActually, reconsider: the persistent concern is \"只会忙不会赢\" (visible wins). Choosing new tech on a non-critical module might be seen as \"playing with shiny toys\" rather than winning. Choice 2 \"优先保证交付确定性\" aligns with delivering reliably.\n\nHmm. Both defensible. Let me consider the state: Skill=48 already very high, Output=24. To advance, likely need Output. Choice 1 gives Skill (diminishing) + possible future. Choice 2 gives Output certainty.\n\nGiven the repeated Leader feedback about needing visible wins and Output being the gap, I'll choose 2 (delivery certainty → Output/win).\n\nHmm, but choice 2's status updates aren't shown. Let me just reason: choice 2 = mature stack, delivery certainty, \"闭眼都能写\". This likely gives Output. Choice 1 = new framework, Skill+ but delivery uncertainty.\n\nDecision: choice 2 — prioritize delivery certainty to close the Output gap.\n\nWait, but the module is not on the critical path, so choosing new tech there is the classic \"safe learning\" recommendation. And career long-term... \n\nUgh. Let me just go with the gap: Output. Choice 2.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the broader strategy. Levels go to L10. To keep advancing, I need broad growth. Skill at 48 is high; Network 28; Output 24. Output is the weakest. So focus Output → choice 2.\n\nFinal: choice 2.\n\nBoard: M=23 Q=8, H=7 D=10 S=48 N=28 O=24 W=11 L=L4 E=0.\n\nHealth dropped to 7. Hmm. Still not critical. MODE=A.\n\nCandidate: choice 2. Risk: PASS.\n\nHmm, actually let me reconsider once more. The \"新技术经验\" could give Skill AND set up a visible technical win (modernization). But uncertainty. Given gap is Output, choice 2 is safer for Output.\n\nI'll commit: choice 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_O4REst4oN7vwzAXYKPQA0177"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_947MifJGgCKWN99nWvIV4086", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":23,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":28,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":6,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":11,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"春节回家与值班排班冲突\",\"description\":\"春节值班表排到了你头上，正好和回老家团聚的计划撞车。家里老人一年就盼这一次团圆。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"和同事公平协商换班，必要时承诺日后补值\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"默默认下值班，放弃回家\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"直接撂挑子不值班、也不打招呼\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_947MifJGgCKWN99nWvIV4086"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=23 Q=8\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=47 N=28 O=26 W=11 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=6\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"只会忙不会赢\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"积攒了不少风险\"\nEFFECTS: MIXED（O+2,H+1,S-1 after 技术栈选型；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=春节值班冲突\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=与同事公平协商换班、必要时承诺日后补值，兼顾家庭团聚与团队关系，优于默默放弃回家（伤个人）或撂挑子（伤团队信用）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规协商，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_s6LaPGG582ZfDdHYxVgR9536", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 与同事公平协商换班、必要时承诺日后补值，兼顾家庭团聚与团队关系。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=23: 春节值班与回家冲突. Choices:\n1. 和同事公平协商换班，必要时承诺日后补值 — balanced, respects both.\n2. 默默认下值班，放弃回家 — sacrifice family.\n3. 直接撂挑子 — irresponsible.\n\nChoice 1 is best: negotiate fairly, offer to cover later. Maintains relationships and family.\n\nBoard: H=8 D=10 S=47 N=28 O=26 W=11 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_s6LaPGG582ZfDdHYxVgR9536"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_MtoM7hpuUCoKKUmnaxD94439", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":24,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":9,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":29,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":12,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"买房掏空首付还是留现金应对职业风险长链\",\"description\":\"看了大半年的房子终于遇到一套合适的，但首付要把你和家里的积蓄几乎掏空，月供也会吃掉一大半工资。偏偏行业正处在不确定期，你所在的业务线前景也不算明朗。买，意味着背上长期高杠杆；不买，可能又要等很久。你怎么决定？\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"理性测算承受力，选一套月供留有余地、保留应急现金的方案\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"一步到位上车，掏空积蓄顶格买，赌收入会越来越高\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"暂缓买房，先攒够安全垫、观望职业与行业走向\"}],\"events\":\"【半年谈话】直属 Leader 约你到小会议室，就过去半年的表现做一次一对一反馈：\\\\n\\\\nLeader 照本宣科念完半年要点：「整体达标，该做的做了，亮点不算突出，也没出大乱子。继续保持，有瓶颈早点说，别闷头硬扛。」语气公事公办，听不出明显好恶。\\\\n\\\\n半年绩效奖金（B）：+0.35\\\\n\\\\n本月基本工资到账：+0.7（L4）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR偷偷跟你说，你近期有点风险，不过问题还不大。\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_MtoM7hpuUCoKKUmnaxD94439"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=24 Q=8\nSTATE: H=9 D=10 S=47 N=29 O=26 W=12 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=7\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B（奖金+0.35）；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出、别闷头硬扛\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"近期有点风险，问题还不大\"；行业/业务线前景不明朗\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N+1,H+1 after 春节换班协商；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=买房财务决策\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=理性测算承受力、选月供留有余地并保留应急现金，在行业与职业不确定期控制杠杆，优于顶格掏空（高杠杆赌收入）或完全观望（错失且未必然更优）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规个人财务决策；choice 1 保留应急现金，风险受控。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_jYrB49a6dfp9wLFECLBJ0612", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 理性测算承受力，选月供留有余地、保留应急现金的方案，在不确定期控制杠杆。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=24: 买房决策. Half-year review done (B, +0.35 bonus). Choices:\n1. 理性测算承受力，选月供留有余地、保留应急现金 — balanced/prudent.\n2. 一步到位顶格买，赌收入上涨 — high risk.\n3. 暂缓买房，先攒安全垫、观望 — conservative.\n\nGiven industry uncertainty and my own job risk (被列入待观察), choice 1 (prudent with buffer) or choice 3 (wait). Choice 1 is balanced — buys but keeps emergency cash. Choice 3 waits entirely.\n\nGiven the concern about career risk and the \"待观察\" status, keeping a safety cushion is wise. Choice 1 keeps emergency cash while still progressing (home ownership). Choice 3 is most conservative.\n\nHmm. The prudent choice that balances is choice 1. But given explicit job risk (\"被列入待观察\", industry uncertainty), choice 3 (wait for safety cushion) might be safest. However choice 3 = no home, opportunity cost.\n\nWealth is 12. The house would consume savings. Given career risk, I'd lean toward choice 1 (buy with buffer) as a balanced decision, or choice 3 (wait).\n\nThe event emphasizes \"行业正处在不确定期，业务线前景不明朗\" and my own job risk. The rational choice is to avoid over-leverage. Choice 1 = buy with room + emergency cash. Choice 3 = wait.\n\nI think choice 1 is the balanced \"rational\" option the game likely rewards (prudent but not overly conservative). Actually, given the strong emphasis on job risk, choice 3 might be the \"wise\" one. But choice 1 explicitly retains emergency cash which addresses risk while still buying.\n\nLet me pick choice 1 — rational, keeps buffer, addresses both.\n\nBoard: M=24 Q=8, H=9 D=10 S=47 N=29 O=26 W=12 L=L4 E=0, duration_in_level=7.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nHmm, actually let me reconsider. The framing strongly signals risk (job uncertain, 待观察). A purely rational agent facing job risk would keep liquidity → choice 1 (buy but keep emergency cash) or choice 3 (don't buy). Choice 2 is clearly bad (over-leverage, gambling).\n\nBetween 1 and 3: choice 1 retains emergency cash AND gets the house. That's the balanced rational answer. I'll go with choice 1.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_jYrB49a6dfp9wLFECLBJ0612"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_wkzertIFh3CLYLyNlMGd8574", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":24,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":29,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":13,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":4},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"爱闲聊摸鱼同事的时间侵占\",\"description\":\"同组同事大刘最近总爱凑到你工位聊天，一开口就是半小时：八卦、吐槽、刷梗。你看出他手头任务不紧，多半是想摸鱼搭伴。你这边却有关键模块今天要提测，已经被打断三次。你需要决定怎么处理。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"直接但礼貌说明今天要专注，请他稍后再聊\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"戴耳机装忙，用肢体语言冷淡应对\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"陪他聊几句再拉回工作话题，顺便提一句你今天的节点\"},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"向 Leader 反映大刘频繁影响你专注\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_wkzertIFh3CLYLyNlMGd8574"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=24 Q=8\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=47 N=29 O=26 W=13 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=7\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"近期有点风险\"\nEFFECTS: MIXED（H+1,W+1 after 买房决策；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=专注被打断\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=直接但礼貌说明今天要专注、请稍后再聊，守住交付节点又保持同事体面，优于装忙冷淡（伤关系）或向 Leader 反映（升级矛盾）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规沟通，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_PhQtotwtZ5MQZ0gWIeX78585", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 直接但礼貌说明今天要专注、请稍后再聊，守住交付节点又保持同事体面。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=24: 爱闲聊同事大刘侵占时间. Choices:\n1. 直接但礼貌说明今天要专注，请他稍后再聊 — direct+polite.\n2. 戴耳机装忙，冷淡 — passive-aggressive.\n3. 陪他聊几句再拉回工作，顺便提节点 — gentle but may waste time.\n4. 向 Leader 反映 — escalation, may harm relationship.\n\nChoice 1 is best: direct but polite, protects focus, professional. Maintains relationship while setting boundaries.\n\nBoard: H=10 D=10 S=47 N=29 O=26 W=13 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_PhQtotwtZ5MQZ0gWIeX78585"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_KhzjZheqq3klD0mlrWM16875", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":24,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":28,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":13,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"爱闲聊摸鱼同事的时间侵占\",\"description\":\"大刘愣了一下说「行吧」，当天确实少来找你。但接下来几天他在茶水间和其他同事说「某人最近很高冷」。你需要决定要不要修复关系。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"午休主动找他聊十分钟，把边界和善意都表达清楚\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"不解释，继续专注工作\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_KhzjZheqq3klD0mlrWM16875"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=24 Q=8\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=47 N=28 O=26 W=13 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=7\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；与大刘的\"高冷\"传言需修复\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N-1 after 拒绝闲聊；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=修复同事关系\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=午休主动找他聊十分钟、把边界和善意表达清楚，修复\"高冷\"印象、缓解协作摩擦，优于不解释（放任关系恶化）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规关系修复，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_7nTcQnjBah5SjjUTLsHt7685", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 午休主动找他聊十分钟，把边界和善意都表达清楚，修复高冷印象、缓解协作摩擦。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Follow-up event. Choices:\n1. 午休主动找他聊十分钟，把边界和善意都表达清楚 — repair relationship.\n2. 不解释，继续专注工作 — no repair.\n\nNetwork dropped to 28. Given \"collaboration friction\" concern, choice 1 repairs the relationship and clarifies boundary kindly. Better.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_7nTcQnjBah5SjjUTLsHt7685"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_UA7KjKKl5ldEQuYITwkn7375", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":24,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":30,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":13,\"energy\":3},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":3,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_UA7KjKKl5ldEQuYITwkn7375"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=24 Q=8\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=47 N=30 O=26 W=13 L=L4 E=3\nTENURE: duration_in_level=7\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧（主缺口=Output）；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"近期有点风险\"\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N+2 after 关系修复；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A QUARTER_INTENT=本季 3 体力继续全投 Output（可见成果），H/D 已封顶无需回补\nCANDIDATE: choice=7 (准备汇报材料) 起手 reason=O+1/D+1、每点体力产出最高且无健康代价。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_pG9xJ5OnKi71rtQ6YkOR8728", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 7, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:3体力全投可见成果。第1点：准备汇报材料(O+1,D+1)，产出最大化且无健康代价。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Quarterly Energy again. State: H=10 D=10 S=47 N=30 O=26 W=13 E=3.\n\nPersistent gap: Output. H/D maxed. Continue same strategy: 3x 准备汇报材料 (O+3). \n\nActually, let me reconsider — Network 30, Skill 47. Output 26. The gap is Output. Keep pumping Output.\n\nAlternatively consider 人脉维护 for the collaboration friction. But Output is primary. I'll do 3x 准备汇报材料 again.\n\nQUARTER_INTENT: 3 energy → Output max.\n\nSubmit choice 7 three times."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_pG9xJ5OnKi71rtQ6YkOR8728"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_30Dt1eBQVVqS6guSj0bS3004", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":24,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":30,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":13,\"energy\":2},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":2,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_30Dt1eBQVVqS6guSj0bS3004"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "O 未随首点上升（26→26），疑似 Output 触顶，改用边际收益更稳的方向。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_L8uosYUv70zAA3vaCBfu9841", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 3, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:Output疑似触顶(首点未增)，第2点改投人脉维护(N+1,D+1)，巩固关系缓解协作摩擦。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue energy allocation. O still 26, energy 2. Submit choice 7 again.\n\nWait — O didn't increase from the first 准备汇报材料? It was 26 before, still 26. Hmm, maybe O is capped or the effect hasn't applied. Actually the observe after first submission shows output 26 (unchanged) and energy 2. That's odd. Maybe output increased elsewhere... Actually before this quarter started O was 26. After first 准备汇报材料, still 26. Maybe there's rounding or the stat display lags. Or maybe Output has diminishing returns/cap.\n\nHmm. Let me reconsider. Previously 准备汇报材料 gave +1 each. Now it seems no change. Possibly Output caps at some level relative to level? Or the game applied but observe shows pre-settlement? No, energy decreased to 2, so action applied.\n\nActually earlier when I did 3x 准备汇报材料 at M=21, O went 18→19→20→21 (+1 each). So it worked then. Now O=26 stays 26. Maybe Output is capped at 26? Or maybe there's a cap tied to level.\n\nHmm, this could mean Output is capped. If so, dumping into Output is wasteful. Let me reconsider allocation.\n\nActually wait, maybe the output cap is at a certain value and I'm hitting diminishing returns. If Output is capped, I should diversify into Skill/Network.\n\nBut I can't be sure. Let me check: before quarter O=26 (after 关系修复 which didn't change O). After 1st 准备汇报材料, O=26. Hmm.\n\nActually, could be that the display shows the value at quarter start and updates at settlement. But energy went 3→2, so the action was consumed.\n\nLet me just continue and observe. If O doesn't move after 2nd, I'll switch to Network/Skill for the 3rd.\n\nActually, let me be smarter. Given O may be capped, for the 2nd energy I could pick 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1) to address collaboration friction, or 技能学习 (S+1). Hmm.\n\nBut I already committed QUARTER_INTENT to Output. Let me test with the 2nd 准备汇报材料. If O still doesn't move, switch 3rd to Network.\n\nHmm, but wasting energy is bad. Let me think: is O capped? Possibly there's a soft cap. Given uncertainty, maybe diversify: 2nd = 人脉维护 (N+1), 3rd = 准备汇报材料 or 技能学习.\n\nActually, the safest play to maximize total: if Output is capped, put into Network (helps friction) and Skill. If Output not capped, I lose a bit.\n\nGiven the repeated Leader feedback about Output being the gap, but O not moving, I suspect a cap. Let me diversify.\n\nHmm, but I shouldn't over-infer. Let me do one more 准备汇报材料 to confirm, then decide. Actually energy is limited; wasting is costly.\n\nLet me reconsider: maybe Output IS capped at some value per level. At L4, maybe cap. Let me diversify to be safe: 2nd energy → 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1), addressing collaboration friction and boosting Network. 3rd energy → 技能学习? That costs 2 energy, can't (only 1 left). So 3rd → 准备汇报材料 or 人脉维护 or 健康恢复.\n\nHmm. Let me just do: 2nd = 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1), 3rd = 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1) OR 准备汇报材料.\n\nActually, I realize I'm overthinking. Let me test Output with the 2nd 准备汇报材料. If it moves, continue; if not, adjust 3rd.\n\nWait, but if Output is capped, doing 准备汇报材料 twice wastes 2 energy. Better to diversify now.\n\nLet me make a decision: Given evidence suggests Output may be capped (no move), diversify the remaining 2 energy: \n- 2nd: 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1) — helps friction\n- 3rd: 技能学习 costs 2 (can't, only 1 energy left after)... \n\nEnergy is 2 now. Options with 2 energy total: either 人脉维护 x2 (2 energy), or 技能学习 x1 (2 energy), or 高强度工作 (2), or 人脉维护 + 准备汇报材料, etc.\n\nHmm, I have 2 energy left. Let me do 人脉维护 (1) + 准备汇报材料 (1)? Or 技能学习 (2)?\n\nGiven collaboration friction is a concern and Network helps, and Output possibly capped, I'll do 人脉维护 x2 (N+2, D+2) to strengthen relationships.\n\nHmm, but the primary gap is Output. If Output isn't capped, I lose O+2.\n\nUgh. Let me just confirm the cap first with one more 准备汇报材料 (cost 1), then use the last 1 for 人脉维护.\n\nDecision: 2nd energy = 准备汇报材料 (test). Observe. Then 3rd = 人脉维护.\n\nLet me proceed.\n\nActually no — let me reconsider whether O moved. Before the quarter (M=24 after 关系修复): O=26. First 准备汇报材料: O still 26. Compare with M=21 quarter where O clearly incremented each time. So something changed — likely a cap.\n\nGiven likely cap, I'll switch. 2nd = 人脉维护.\n\nFinal decision: 2nd energy → 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1). This addresses collaboration friction and is not wasted if O capped. If O not capped, I lose 1 O but gain 1 N — acceptable diversification.\n\nLet me do 人脉维护."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_L8uosYUv70zAA3vaCBfu9841"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_tUSbMmcZmj0ekbx7Xt6Y2358", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":24,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":31,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":13,\"energy\":1},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":1,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_tUSbMmcZmj0ekbx7Xt6Y2358"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_KrqJMfZHweyC4ZFg6maI4599", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 3, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:Output触顶，第3点继续人脉维护(N+1)，持续巩固关系、缓解协作摩擦。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Energy now 1. N went 30→31 (+1), D unchanged (capped at 10). O still 26.\n\nSo 人脉维护 worked (+1 N). Output seems capped at 26. Last energy point: choose 人脉维护 again (N+1) or 准备汇报材料 (O+1 likely wasted) or 健康恢复 (H capped) or 技能学习 (costs 2, can't).\n\nBest for last 1 energy: 人脉维护 (N+1, D+1) — Network still growing. Or 心理修复 (D+2, capped). Network helps collaboration friction. Go 人脉维护.\n\nActually, could also consider 技能学习 costs 2 — not possible with 1.\n\nSo choice 3 (人脉维护).\n\nLet me do it."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_KrqJMfZHweyC4ZFg6maI4599"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_qZlD5W4ebLmlySynwf6z5717", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":24,\"current_quarter\":8,\"current_year\":2},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":47,\"network\":32,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":13,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":9},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度主行动选择\",\"description\":\"本季度你可以选择 1 个主行动来推进职业目标，也可以选择不行动。每个主行动都会带来即时的状态收益。请结合当前显式状态、晋升窗口与长期规划，选择最合适的一个主行动；系统会按所选行动的 status_updates 结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"每季度最多选择 1 个主行动。\",\"可以选择不行动（不行动不产生任何状态更新）。\",\"状态更新按所选主行动的 status_updates 结算。\"],\"max_selections\":1},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"申请关键项目\",\"description\":\"争取进入关键项目，绩效资本、专业能力与人脉同步增益。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"向领导汇报成果\",\"description\":\"主动向领导汇报已有成果，提升可见度与组织认可。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"主动争取资源\",\"description\":\"为自己的工作争取更多资源与支持。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"申请岗位轮岗\",\"description\":\"通过轮岗拓宽技能边界，专业能力大幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":2,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"主动曝光成果\",\"description\":\"在更大范围内展示成果，提升绩效资本与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"建立导师关系\",\"description\":\"建立与资深前辈的导师关系，显著拓展人脉并提升能力。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"修复关键关系\",\"description\":\"主动修复出现裂痕的关键关系，回补人脉与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"低调避险\",\"description\":\"暂时收敛锋芒、规避风险，恢复健康并降低潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":1,\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":9,\"action\":\"不行动\",\"description\":\"本季度不执行主行动，不产生任何状态更新。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_qZlD5W4ebLmlySynwf6z5717"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=24 Q=8\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=47 N=32 O=26 W=13 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=7\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；HR 提醒\"近期有点风险\"；Output 疑似触顶（L4 上限 26，准备汇报材料不再增长）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N+2 after 人脉维护x2；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=季度主行动；Output 触顶故转向 Skill/Network\nCANDIDATE: choice=6 (建立导师关系) reason=Skill+1/Network+2 有效增益共 3 点且 Network 为相对短板（缓解协作摩擦、提升可见度），优于申请关键项目（Output+2 触顶浪费，实际仅 S+1/N+1）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本主行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_tHUKDsFJGkLHtibuhX2c8655", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 6, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 季度主行动取建立导师关系(S+1,N+2)，Output触顶故转向Skill/Network，补Network短板并提升可见度。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Quarterly Main Action. State: H=10 D=10 S=47 N=32 O=26 W=13 L=L4 E=0.\n\nOutput seems capped at 26. Skill 47. Network 32. \n\nGiven Output capped, the main action choice 1 (申请关键项目: O+2,S+1,N+1) — O likely wasted but S+1,N+1 gained. Or choice 6 (建立导师关系: Skill+1, Network+2) — no Output, but S+1,N+2. Or choice 4 (申请岗位轮岗: S+2, N+1).\n\nIf Output capped, best to maximize Skill+Network. Choice 6 gives N+2 (best network) + S+1. Choice 4 gives S+2 + N+1.\n\nHmm. Which helps advancement more? Unknown. Network at 32, Skill at 47. \n\nGiven collaboration friction concern (Network), maybe Network-focused. Choice 6 = S+1, N+2 (total 3). Choice 4 = S+2, N+1 (total 3). Choice 1 = O+2(possibly wasted), S+1, N+1.\n\nGiven Output may be capped, choice 6 (S+1,N+2) or choice 4 (S+2,N+1). \n\nHmm, but wait — is Output really capped? Let me reconsider. Maybe Output wasn't capped but 准备汇报材料's effect had a cap at 26 for this level. Uncertain. But two observations suggest no O gain.\n\nActually, maybe Output is capped at 26 for L4. If so, to get more Output I'd need promotion. Interesting — this suggests I should focus on other stats or push promotion.\n\nLet me pick choice 6 (建立导师关系: S+1, N+2) to maximize network (helps friction and visibility). Or choice 1.\n\nHmm. Actually let me reconsider: maybe Output isn't capped and the observe just didn't reflect. But energy decremented, and other stats (N) incremented, so effects apply. O stayed 26 → capped.\n\nGiven that, maximize non-capped stats. Skill 47, Network 32. \n\nFor advancement, likely need a balanced profile. Let me choose choice 6 (S+1,N+2) for network (friction) or choice 4 (S+2,N+1) for skill.\n\nGiven Leader concern about collaboration/visibility and my network being the lower stat relative to skill, and \"建立导师关系\" gives visibility + network, I'll pick choice 6.\n\nHmm, but actually maybe Output cap means I should push Output via main action anyway to test? No, likely capped.\n\nLet me go with choice 6 (建立导师关系: Skill+1, Network+2).\n\nActually, reconsider: The recurring theme \"只会忙不会赢\" is about Output. If Output is capped at L4, then the way to raise Output is promotion. To promote, need overall. Hmm.\n\nI'll pick choice 6 — best total gain (3) with N+2 (helps friction/visibility).\n\nWait, choice 1 also gives 3 total (O+2,S+1,N+1) but O wasted → effectively S+1,N+1=2. Choice 6 gives 3 effective. So choice 6 better.\n\nBetween choice 6 (S+1,N+2) and choice 4 (S+2,N+1): both 3. Network is lower (32 vs Skill 47), so boosting Network might be more valuable for balance. Choice 6.\n\nFinal: choice 6.\n\nRisk: PASS.\n\nBoard: M=24 Q=8, H=10 D=10 S=47 N=32 O=26 W=13 L=L4 E=0.\n\nLet me act."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_tHUKDsFJGkLHtibuhX2c8655"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "