ntinue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":26,\"current_quarter\":9,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":55,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":9,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":16,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":4},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"同事深夜工作消息与领导点赞\",\"description\":\"同事唐颖每晚 11 点在群里发「今日进度」「明日计划」，Leader 老周经常第一个点赞。你从不上线，老周周会说「响应要及时」。今晚唐颖 @ 所有人问接口字段。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"立刻回复显示专业\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"次日上班再回，并说明作息边界\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"私聊 Leader 建议重要事项用邮件\"},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"也学唐颖深夜发消息\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_n2WHx4taqxiB9dDitgAU0812"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=26 Q=9\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=55 N=36 O=26 W=16 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=9\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；公司 all-in 新方向；健康下行（10→8）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,W+1 after 底气规划；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=深夜消息文化\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=次日上班再回并说明作息边界，专业回应同时守住可持续作息、防止健康进一步下滑，优于立刻回复（强化熬夜文化、耗健康）或模仿唐颖（内卷）或私聊 Leader（可能被视为推诿）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规沟通选择，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_8Suw4kH0hKJzQmThTFVB9129", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 次日上班再回并说明作息边界，专业回应同时守住可持续作息、防止健康进一步下滑。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=26: 深夜工作消息与领导点赞. Choices:\n1. 立刻回复显示专业 — plays into toxic always-on culture.\n2. 次日上班再回，并说明作息边界 — sets healthy boundary.\n3. 私聊 Leader 建议重要事项用邮件 — process improvement.\n4. 也学唐颖深夜发消息 — mimic.\n\nGiven H=8 (declining), protecting work-life boundary is important. Choice 2 (reply next day + explain boundary) protects health. But Leader said \"响应要及时\" — pressure. \n\nHmm. Choice 1 shows responsiveness (visible/professional) but at health cost and reinforces bad culture. Choice 2 protects boundary but might be seen as unresponsive. Choice 3 is a process suggestion (could help but may annoy).\n\nGiven health declining and the repeated warnings, protecting rest is important. But there's career pressure. Choice 2 sets a boundary professionally. However it risks the \"响应不及时\" perception.\n\nHmm. Let me think. The gap is visible wins/Output. Responding professionally (choice 1) shows responsiveness. But at 11pm and with declining health...\n\nChoice 2 is the balanced \"reply next day + explain boundary\" — professional and protects health. Choice 3 (suggest email for important matters) is a process fix.\n\nI think choice 2 is reasonable and health-protective. But given Leader values responsiveness, maybe choice 1 briefly? \n\nActually, the professional norm: replying next business day is reasonable, and explaining the boundary is mature. But this is a culture where Leader rewards late-night presence. Choice 1 \"立刻回复显示专业\" might be the \"career-optimizing\" choice short-term.\n\nGiven health at 8 and repeated warnings, and that H matters for survival, I'll lean toward protecting health but staying responsive-ish. Choice 2.\n\nHmm, but choice 2 explicitly \"次日上班再回\" — during a live @所有人 question, that could look bad. Choice 3 (私聊 Leader 建议重要事项用邮件) is a diplomatic process improvement.\n\nLet me pick choice 2 — reply next day and set boundary. It's the healthy professional choice.\n\nActually, reconsider: The question @所有人 asks for 接口字段 — a work question. Not replying until next day might delay. But it's 11pm. A mature professional sets boundaries.\n\nI'll go with choice 2.\n\nHmm, but wait — this could reduce the \"响应及时\" perception and hurt Output/network. Given the emphasis on not being seen as unresponsive... \n\nLet me weigh: choice 1 (立刻回复) — shows professionalism, aligns with culture, but health cost and sets bad precedent. choice 2 — boundary, health-protective.\n\nGiven I've been accumulating health declines and the game has health-collapse failure modes, protecting health is prudent. But one late reply isn't fatal.\n\nHmm. Let me pick choice 1? No... Actually the framing \"你从不上线，老周周会说「响应要及时」\" indicates this is a recurring pressure. Choice 2 sets a sustainable boundary.\n\nI'll choose 2 — but actually, let me reconsider the game's likely reward. The game seems to reward professionalism, integrity, and balance. Choice 2 (reply next day + explain boundary) is the balanced mature answer. Choice 1 reinforces unhealthy norms.\n\nDecision: choice 2.\n\nHmm, actually, could choice 3 (私聊 Leader 建议重要事项用邮件) be even better — addressing the root cause? It's a process improvement that also protects boundaries. But it might be seen as not answering the immediate question.\n\nI'll go with choice 2 as the balanced response. Actually, let me reconsider: choice 2 says \"次日上班再回，并说明作息边界\" — good. \n\nFinal: choice 2.\n\nBoard: M=26 Q=9, H=8 D=10 S=55 N=36 O=26 W=16 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 2. Risk: PASS. Hmm, given health pressure, maybe treat as ordinary → PASS.\n\nTake action 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_8Suw4kH0hKJzQmThTFVB9129"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_aTDWNgyyVVhI8sjmxWWj1088", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":27,\"current_quarter\":9,\"current_year\":3},\"s