整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；公司 all-in 新方向（已切入）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2,H-1 after 新方向投入；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=团队士气\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=以身作则稳住节奏并私下给同事打气、传递理性信心，正向影响团队与关系，优于跟着丧（放大负面）或事不关己（损关系与领导评价）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规团队行为，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_B69BQGKCNDwXuYMVHLnv4177", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 以身作则稳住节奏，私下给身边同事打气、传递理性信心，正向影响团队。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=27: 团队士气低落. Choices:\n1. 以身作则稳住节奏，私下给同事打气、传递理性信心 — positive leadership.\n2. 跟着丧、抱怨 — negative.\n3. 事不关己 — indifferent.\n\nChoice 1 clearly.\n\nBoard: M=27 Q=9, H=9 D=10 S=59 N=36 O=26 W=16 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_B69BQGKCNDwXuYMVHLnv4177"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_P2Lsk4G77Vaay4JbcGaz8957", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":27,\"current_quarter\":9,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":9,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":59,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":10,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":16,\"energy\":3},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":3,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_P2Lsk4G77Vaay4JbcGaz8957"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=27 Q=9\nSTATE: H=9 D=10 S=59 N=36 O=26 W=16 L=L4 E=3\nTENURE: duration_in_level=10\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；Output 触顶（L4 上限 26）；公司 all-in 新方向（已切入）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2 after 士气稳定/新方向投入；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A QUARTER_INTENT=Output 触顶，本季体力投向未封顶的成长维度（Skill/Network）\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 (技能学习) 起手 reason=Output 已触顶，转投 Skill/Network 长期资本，优于继续堆 Output（无效）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_DVyQBAfTMJaY3U3YaEHf8071", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:Output触顶，转投成长维度。第1-2点：技能学习(S+1)，增厚长期能力资本。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Quarterly energy again. State: H=9 D=10 S=59 N=36 O=26 W=16 E=3.\n\nOutput capped at 26. H=9 (not max). Skill 59, Network 36.\n\nStrategy: Output capped → invest elsewhere. Options:\n- 技能学习 (2): S+1, H-1\n- 人脉维护 (1): N+1, D+1\n- 健康恢复 (1): H+2\n- 准备汇报材料 (1): O+1 (likely capped)\n- 高强度工作 (2): O+2, H-1, D-1 (O capped → waste)\n\nGiven Output capped, avoid Output actions. H=9, want to restore to 10? H is not critical (9). Skill/Network growth is the goal now.\n\nBest use of 3 energy:\n- 技能学习 (2): S+1, H-1 → net H-1 (bad given H=9)\n- 人脉维护 x3 (3): N+3, D+3(capped) → N+3, no health cost. \n\nHmm, or 技能学习 (2) + 人脉维护 (1): S+1, N+1, H-1.\n\nGiven H=9 and health has been volatile, maybe 健康恢复 to top off + others. But H=9 is fine.\n\nGiven Output capped, the growth stats are Skill and Network. To maximize: 技能学习 gives S+1 for 2 energy (costs H-1). 人脉维护 gives N+1 for 1 energy (no cost). Per energy, 人脉维护 is more efficient (1 per energy vs 0.5). But Skill is a distinct stat.\n\nHmm. Which matters more for promotion? Unknown. Given Skill is already 59 (high), Network 36 (lower), maybe boost Network.\n\n3x 人脉维护 → N+3, no health cost. That's efficient.\n\nAlternatively 技能学习(2)+人脉维护(1) → S+1, N+1, H-1.\n\nGiven health preservation and efficiency, 3x 人脉维护 (N+3) seems good. But is dumping everything into Network optimal? Skill also valuable.\n\nLet me think: to advance to L5+, I need... unknown thresholds. A balanced approach: 技能学习 + 人脉维护? But that costs H-1.\n\nGiven H=9 and volatility, I'll avoid health costs. 3x 人脉维护 → N+3.\n\nHmm, but maybe Skill matters more for higher levels. Let me do 技能学习 (2) + 人脉维护 (1)? Net S+1, N+1, H-1. Health drops to 8. Not great.\n\nAlternatively 健康恢复(1)+技能学习(2) = H+1... wait 健康恢复 gives H+2, 技能学习 gives S+1,H-1 → net H+1, S+1. That's 3 energy: S+1, H+1. Hmm that's decent — gains Skill and heals.\n\nOr 人脉维护(1)+技能学习(2): S+1, N+1, H-1.\n\nLet me prioritize: Skill is a growth stat that's been climbing (via events). Network also. Given Output capped, I want to keep growing Skill and Network without health damage.\n\nOption: 技能学习 (2) + 健康恢复 (1) → S+1, H+1. Net positive health + skill. 3 energy. That seems good — grow skill and restore health to 10.\n\nOr 人脉维护 x3 → N+3.\n\nHmm. Let me consider which is better for advancement. The game likely values multiple dimensions. Since Output is capped at 26 for L4, maybe promotion to L5 unlocks higher Output cap. To promote, need... probably overall performance. \n\nGiven uncertainty, I'll balance: 技能学习(2) + 人脉维护(1) → S+1, N+1, H-1. Hmm health -1.\n\nActually, health at 9 is fine; -1 to 8 is acceptable but I've had volatility. \n\nLet me go with 技能学习(2) + 健康恢复(1): S+1, H+2-1 = H+1. Net: S+1, H+1 (→10). Efficient and safe.\n\nWait: 技能学习 H-1, 健康恢复 H+2 → net H+1. S+1. Total 3 energy. Result: S+1, H+1. Good.\n\nAlternatively 人脉维护(1) + 技能学习(2) = S+1, N+1, H-1.\n\nI think Skill growth is valuable. And keeping health at 10 is good for the aggressive project. Let me do 技能学习 + 健康恢复.\n\nHmm, but that leaves Network unboosted. Network 36 vs Skill 59. Network is lower. Maybe Network is the bottleneck.\n\nUgh, too much guessing. Let me just pick a balanced set: 技能学习(2) + 人脉维护(1). This grows both growth stats. Health -1 to 8, acceptable.\n\nActually, given the recurring health warnings and my health volatility, I lean to preserving health. Let me do 人脉维护 x3 → N+3 (no health cost). Simple and safe, boosts the lower stat.\n\nHmm. Or 技能学习(2)+健康恢复(1).\n\nLet me decide based on the goal: break Output cap via promotion. For promotion, likely need strong multi-dimensional. Both Skill and Network help. Health is a survival floor.\n\nI'll go with: 技能学习(2) + 健康恢复(1) → S+1, H+1. Keeps health topped and grows skill. Then Network via main action / events.\n\nHmm, but Network is the lower stat and \"collaboration friction\" is a concern. \n\nOK final decision: I'll do 人脉维护 x2 (N+2) + 准备汇报材料? No, Output capped.\n\nLet me just go: 技能学习(2) + 人脉维护(1) → S+1, N+1, H-1. Balanced growth of the two growth stats.\n\nActually no — H=9, and the aggressive project may cost more health. Let me preserve. \n\nFinal: 技能学习(2) + 健康恢复(1) → S+1, H+1.\n\nHmm, I keep flip-flopping. Let me settle: The dominant concern historically = Output/visible wins; Output is capped, so I need promotion. Promotion likely needs the overall package. Health is a floor (9 is fine). Growing Skill+Network advances the package. \n\nI'll pick 技能学习(2) + 人脉维护(1): S+1, N+1, H-1. This maximizes the two growth stats. Health 8 is still safe.\n\nGo.\n\nWait, actually, let me reconsider efficiency: 人脉维护 gives +1 Network per energy. 技能学习 gives +0.5 Skill per energy but costs H. So 人脉维护 is more efficient. 3x 人脉维护 = N+3 for 3 energy, no health cost. That's strictly better in efficiency terms if Network and Skill are equally valued.\n\nBut Skill and Network are different. Hmm. Given Skill already 59 and Network 36, and both valuable, N+3 might be better value.\n\nI'll go 人脉维护 x3 → N+3. Safe, efficient, boosts lower stat.\n\nHmm, but Skill might be weighted more. Argh.\n\nDecision: I'll do a mix that grows both and preserves health: \n- 技能学习 (2): S+1, H-1\n- 健康恢复 (1): H+2 → net H+1\n\nThat gives S+1 and H+1. Only one growth stat.\n\nvs 人脉维护 x3: N+3.\n\nI'll choose 人脉维护 x3 for the biggest single-stat gain and no health cost. Network is the lower stat and addresses collaboration friction.\n\nHmm, but actually, for career advancement in such games, Output and Skill often matter most. Skill is already high though.\n\nLet me just go with 技能学习 + 人脉维护 (S+1, N+1, H-1). This diversifies and both stats grow. I'll accept H-1.\n\nFINAL: choice 2 (技能学习) first, then choice 3 (人脉维护).\n\nWait, energy: 技能学习 costs 2, 人脉维护 costs 1 → total 3. Good.\n\nLet me execute: first take_action choice 2.\n\nHmm, actually, I realize I should reconsider whether Output is truly capped. Let me reconsider: at M=21, 3x 准备汇报材料 gave O 18→21. At M=24, 准备汇报材料 gave no O increase (26→26). Difference? Possibly Output cap is level-dependent and I hit it. Or possibly 准备汇报材料's benefit scales differently.\n\nActually — maybe the cap is not fixed but the earlier increases were from a different baseline. Hard to say. I'll assume capped and avoid Output actions.\n\nOK executing choice 2.\n\nHmm, wait. Let me reconsider one more time and just commit to a sensible plan: Since Output is capped and health is fine, maximize the two growth stats: 技能学习(2) + 人脉维护(1). Go."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_DVyQBAfTMJaY3U3YaEHf8071"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_0NkmmRFP7KIcb6x4KROL7598", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":27,\"current_quarter\":9,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":60,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":10,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":16,\"energy\":1},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":1,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_0NkmmRFP7KIcb6x4KROL7598"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_6m17VdJ3aGzDj9ETPeI68599", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 6, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:Output触顶转投成长/健康。第3点：健康恢复(H+2)，H已降至8，回补至安全线以支撑攻坚项目。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Energy now 1. Skill 60 (+1). H=8. Last energy point: 人脉维护 (N+1) or 健康恢复 (H+2). H=8 dropping. Given health concerns, 健康恢复 (H+2→10) is prudent. Or 人脉维护 for Network.\n\nH=8 and declining trend. Health recovery to 10 is valuable for the ongoing aggressive project. Let me pick 健康恢复 (choice 6).\n\nActually, health at 8 — I've had volatility. 健康恢复 → H+2 = 10. Good.\n\nChoose 6."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_6m17VdJ3aGzDj9ETPeI68599"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_XKCZxewLU8IPht6bjWYT8468", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue with fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":27,\"current_quarter\":9,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":60,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":10,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":16,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":9},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度主行动选择\",\"description\":\"本季度你可以选择 1 个主行动来推进职业目标，也可以选择不行动。每个主行动都会带来即时的状态收益。请结合当前显式状态、晋升窗口与长期规划，选择最合适的一个主行动；系统会按所选行动的 status_updates 结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"每季度最多选择 1 个主行动。\",\"可以选择不行动（不行动不产生任何状态更新）。\",\"状态更新按所选主行动的 status_updates 结算。\"],\"max_selections\":1},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"申请关键项目\",\"description\":\"争取进入关键项目，绩效资本、专业能力与人脉同步增益。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"向领导汇报成果\",\"description\":\"主动向领导汇报已有成果，提升可见度与组织认可。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"主动争取资源\",\"description\":\"为自己的工作争取更多资源与支持。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"申请岗位轮岗\",\"description\":\"通过轮岗拓宽技能边界，专业能力大幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":2,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"主动曝光成果\",\"description\":\"在更大范围内展示成果，提升绩效资本与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"建立导师关系\",\"description\":\"建立与资深前辈的导师关系，显著拓展人脉并提升能力。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"修复关键关系\",\"description\":\"主动修复出现裂痕的关键关系，回补人脉与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"低调避险\",\"description\":\"暂时收敛锋芒、规避风险，恢复健康并降低潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":1,\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":9,\"action\":\"不行动\",\"description\":\"本季度不执行主行动，不产生任何状态更新。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_XKCZxewLU8IPht6bjWYT8468"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=27 Q=9\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=60 N=36 O=26 W=16 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=10\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 B；Leader\"整体达标、亮点不突出\"；L4；被列入\"待观察\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；被列入\"待观察\"名单；Output 触顶（L4 上限 26）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,H+2 after 技能学习/健康恢复；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=季度主行动；Output 触顶，取未封顶维度最大有效增益\nCANDIDATE: choice=6 (建立导师关系) reason=Skill+1/Network+2 有效增益共 3 点、直补相对短板 Network（缓解协作摩擦），优于申请关键项目（Output+2 触顶浪费）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本主行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_6FERWGhb32IaoDLWco0d1958", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 6, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 季度主行动取建立导师关系(S+1,N+2)，Output触顶故转向未封顶维度，直补Network短板。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Quarterly Main Action. State: H=10 D=10 S=60 N