kill\":82,\"network\":35,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":16,\"output\":25,\"wealth\":21,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":9},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度主行动选择\",\"description\":\"本季度你可以选择 1 个主行动来推进职业目标，也可以选择不行动。每个主行动都会带来即时的状态收益。请结合当前显式状态、晋升窗口与长期规划，选择最合适的一个主行动；系统会按所选行动的 status_updates 结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"每季度最多选择 1 个主行动。\",\"可以选择不行动（不行动不产生任何状态更新）。\",\"状态更新按所选主行动的 status_updates 结算。\"],\"max_selections\":1},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"申请关键项目\",\"description\":\"争取进入关键项目，绩效资本、专业能力与人脉同步增益。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"向领导汇报成果\",\"description\":\"主动向领导汇报已有成果，提升可见度与组织认可。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"主动争取资源\",\"description\":\"为自己的工作争取更多资源与支持。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"申请岗位轮岗\",\"description\":\"通过轮岗拓宽技能边界，专业能力大幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":2,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"主动曝光成果\",\"description\":\"在更大范围内展示成果，提升绩效资本与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"建立导师关系\",\"description\":\"建立与资深前辈的导师关系，显著拓展人脉并提升能力。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"修复关键关系\",\"description\":\"主动修复出现裂痕的关键关系，回补人脉与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"低调避险\",\"description\":\"暂时收敛锋芒、规避风险，恢复健康并降低潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":1,\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":9,\"action\":\"不行动\",\"description\":\"本季度不执行主行动，不产生任何状态更新。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_NgooDdpUsR0qE153WDAS4718"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=33 Q=11\nSTATE: H=9 D=10 S=82 N=35 O=25 W=21 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=16\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A（+1.05）；Leader\"能扛事、把功夫花在产出和关系上，半年后再看一档\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；Output 触顶（~26）；Network 修复中（34→35）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+1,N+1 after 技能学习/人脉维护；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=季度主行动；Output 触顶，取已确认仍增长的 Skill 最大增益\nCANDIDATE: choice=4 (申请岗位轮岗) reason=Skill+2/Network+1，Skill 确认持续增长（82），有效增益最大，兼顾关系修复，优于其他单项行动。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本主行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_QphJ0e3D7LYWcBwBN4zi3633", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 4, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 季度主行动取申请岗位轮岗(S+2,N+1)，Skill确认持续增长，Output触顶下有效增益最大并兼顾关系。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Main action. State: H=9 D=10 S=82 N=35 O=25 W=21 L=L4 E=0.\n\nOutput capped, Network repairing, Skill growing. Choose main action maximizing effective gain. Skill grows (82). Network 35 (maybe can reach 36). Output capped.\n\nChoice 4 (申请岗位轮岗: S+2, N+1) → S+2 effective. Choice 6 (建立导师关系: S+1, N+2) → S+1 (+N up to cap). Choice 1 (O+2 capped, S+1, N+1) → S+1.\n\nBest effective: choice 4 (S+2, N+1). Skill confirmed growing.\n\nCandidate: choice 4. Risk: PASS.\n\nExecute choice 4.\n\nHmm, I've been alternating. Let me go with choice 4 (S+2).\n\nActually, given Network is the weak/declining stat and Leader emphasized relationships, maybe choice 6 (S+1, N+2)? But if Network caps at 36, N+2 only yields +1. Skill+2 (choice 4) is more reliable.\n\nGiven uncertainty, choice 4 (S+2, N+1) gives S+2 reliably + N+1. I'll pick choice 4.\n\nBoard: M=33 Q=11, H=9 D=10 S=82 N=35 O=25 W=21 L=L4 E=0.\n\nExecute."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_QphJ0e3D7LYWcBwBN4zi3633"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_48U8VzVxdK3dDemJambM8486", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":34,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":9,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":84,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":17,\"output\":25,\"wealth\":22,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"带病坚持上班的同事长链\",\"description\":\"邻座同事阿芳重感冒，咳嗽不断、嗓子哑得说不出话，却坚持来上班，说「项目节点紧，不能掉链子」。整个开放区都能听见她此起彼伏的咳嗽，已经有两个同事开始打喷嚏。她是出于责任心，但也确实存在传染风险。你正好和她在同一个项目上。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"私下关心她，劝她回去休息，并主动提出帮她顶一部分紧急任务\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"找领导反映「带病上班影响大家健康」，建议安排她居家办公\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"嫌她吵又怕被传染，自己戴口罩躲远点，不吭声\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+0.7（L4）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_48U8VzVxdK3dDemJambM8486"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_l2xJKfykcKbhRBkmub960434", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 私下关心阿芳、劝她回去休息，并主动帮她顶一部分紧急任务，兼顾她健康与团队传染风险。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=34: 带病坚持上班的同事. Choices:\n1. 私下关心她，劝她回去休息，并主动提出帮她顶一部分紧急任务 — caring + helpful.\n2. 找领导反映\"带病上班影响大家健康\"，建议居家办公 — escalate.\n3. 戴口罩躲远点，不吭声 — passive.\n\nChoice 1 is best: caring, helpful, addresses both her wellbeing and the contagion risk without escalating.\n\nBoard: M=34 Q=12, H=9 D=10 S=84 N=36 O=25 W=22 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_l2xJKfykcKbhRBkmub960434"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_xEl2qjmudtykmFGj0i2F5040", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":34,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":85,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":17,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":22,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"降本增效福利缩水要不要抱怨\",\"description\":\"公司喊出『降本增效』，取消了一些福利、收紧了报销和团建预算。茶水间里大家怨声载道，有人起头吐槽公司『越来越抠』。你心里也不太舒服。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"理解大环境压力，把注意力放回提升自身价值上，不参与抱怨\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"带头公开抱怨、煽动大家一起声讨公司\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"用消极怠工『抵制』，福利没了活也少干\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_xEl2qjmudtykmFGj0i2F5040"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_zsLlaMQXMr15FLWQkstg5547", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 理解大环境压力，把注意力放回提升自身价值上，不参与抱怨，保持理性与正向态度。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=34: 降本增效福利缩水. Choices:\n1. 理解大环境压力，把注意力放回提升自身价值上，不参与抱怨 — positive.\n2. 带头公开抱怨 — bad.\n3. 消极怠工 — bad.\n\nChoice 1.\n\nBoard: M=34 Q=12, H=8 D=10 S=85 N=36 O=26 W=22 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_zsLlaMQXMr15FLWQkstg5547"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_Ag912aCLftdiyrpzd3IZ9708", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":34,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":86,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":17,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":22,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"跨部门重大事故是否主动支援\",\"description\":\"支付清算中心昨晚 P0：与「星瀚科技」无关的底层账务服务数据错乱，责任在基础平台部。你的「灵犀支付」组未被问责。但平台总监在高管群 @ 所有支付相关 TL：「懂账务的快来。」 若你去，至少连续一周凌晨 on-call，你本周还要交「会员权益」方案。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"主动请缨加入救火小组\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"在群里表示可远程答疑两小时，不现场驻场\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"沉默，专注自有项目\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_Ag912aCLftdiyrpzd3IZ9708"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=34 Q=12\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=86 N=36 O=26 W=22 L=L4 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=17\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A（+1.05）；Leader\"能扛事、把功夫花在产出和关系上，半年后再看一档\"\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧；Output 触顶（~26）；健康偏低（8）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（O+1,H-1 after 带病同事关怀；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=跨部门 P0 求援；健康偏低(8)且有自有交付，取平衡支援\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=在群里表示可远程答疑两小时、不现场驻场，展现跨部门善意与专业支援，同时守住自有交付与偏低健康，优于全周驻场（耗竭健康、危及交付）或沉默（错失善意与曝光）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规支援选择；choice 2 控制投入，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_MYIdn5BeQ23pxIFUhZ5I6544", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 在群里表示可远程答疑两小时、不现场驻场，展现跨部门善意与支援，同时守住自有交付与偏低健康。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=34: 跨部门重大事故是否主动支援. Choices:\n1. 主动请缨加入救火小组 — full commitment (1 week on-call).\n2. 在群里表示可远程答疑两小时，不现场驻场 — balanced support.\n3. 沉默，专注自有项目 — no help.\n\nGiven H=8 (health declining), and I have a deliverable this week, choice 2 (offer 2h remote help without on-site) balances helping and self-protection. Choice 1 is heroic but at health cost (already low). Choice 3 is selfish.\n\nGiven health at 8 and the \"visible win\"/relationships goal, choice 2 offers help (builds cross-team relationships/visibility) without over-committing. Good balance.\n\nHmm, but choice 1 could be a big visible win (救火) → career boost. But H=8 and I'd burn out. Risk of health collapse.\n\nGiven health concerns, choice 2 is prudent. But the game might reward choice 1 (heroic). Hmm.\n\nGiven my health is at 8 and declining, and I have a deliverable, I'll choose choice 2 — offer remote help (2h) which shows willingness without jeopardizing health/deliverable.\n\nActually, this is a P0 crisis — cross-department. Stepping up could be a major visible win. But H=8... The game has health-collapse failure modes. Given repeated health warnings, protecting health matters.\n\nChoice 2 balances: helps, shows goodwill, limits commitment.\n\nCandidate: choice 2. Risk: PASS.\n\nBoard: M=34 Q=12, H=8 D=10 S=86 N=36 O=26 W=22 L=L4 E=0.\n\nTake action 2.\n\nHmm, actually let me reconsider. The event is a P0 across departments. \"懂账务的快来\" — platform director calls for help. My group isn't blamed. Choice 1 (full help) = visible win + relationship with platform director. Choice 2 (remote 2h) = moderate help.\n\nGiven the game rewards visible wins and relationships, and this is a chance to shine cross-departmentally, choice 1 might be better for career. But health at 8 and a deliverable this week → risk.\n\nGiven H=8 and my consistent pattern of protecting health, I'll go with choice 2. It's the balanced, sustainable choice.\n\nHmm, but earlier I chose aggressive options (攻坚项目) when health was 10. Now health is 8. Let me consider: is choice 2 enough to get credit? It shows willingness. Probably decent.\n\nI'll go with choice 2.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: could there be a health consequence from choice 1 that triggers a crisis? H=8, -1 or -2 could drop to 6-7. Not collapse yet. And choice 1 might give big career gains. Hmm.\n\nThe game's aggressive-advancement strategy (MODE A) favors choice 1. But health is a survival constraint. The rolling-planning says switch to stabilization only for material public survival constraints. Is H=8 a material survival constraint? Not clearly — 8/10 is healthy. So MODE=A → aggressive → choice 1?\n\nHmm. But choice 1 commits \"至少连续一周凌晨 on-call\" which is a big health/time cost with an existing deliverable. That could jeopardize the deliverable and health.\n\nBalanced: choice 2 gives help without full commitment. I think choice 2 is the smart play given the existing deliverable.\n\nHmm, the strategy says default aggressive. But it also says protect survival. Let me weigh: the deliverable (会员权益方案) is my own Output work. Full救火 commitment could hurt it.\n\nI'll go with choice 2 — offer remote help, protect deliverable and health. This still builds cross-team goodwill.\n\nFinal: choice 2.\n\nHmm, wait, but actually the game might see choice 2 as half-hearted and reward choice 1's full commitment. Argh.\n\nLet me think about the game's likely design: a P0 crisis with a cross-department call for help. The \"correct\" answer for a team player with integrity might be choice 1 (step up). But given the personal cost (1 week on-call + deliverable), choice 2 is the balanced \"smart\" answer.\n\nI'll go with choice 2. Decision made.\n\nBoard update and action."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_MYIdn5BeQ23pxIFUhZ5I6544"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_NPslg9GvneDDZV6IvMFl0155", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":35,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":87,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":18,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":23,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"带病坚持上班的同事长链\",\"description\":\"阿芳很感动，但还是犹豫：「这怎么好意思，你也有自己的活。」你顶下了她手上最急的一块。她回家休息了。可你的本职工作因此排得很满，节点临近，你有点吃力。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"向领导同步「临时帮阿芳顶岗」，争取合理的排期支持\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"默默全扛，不声张，自己加班补上\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+0.7（L4）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_NPslg9GvneDDZV6IvMFl0155"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_jBJ0ER1Sb5TLVb551EeB7252", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 向领导同步\\\"临时帮阿芳顶岗\\\"并争取合理排期支持，透明沟通避免默默过劳。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=35: 帮阿芳顶岗后本职排满. Choices:\n1. 向领导同步\"临时帮阿芳顶岗\"，争取合理排期支持 — transparent + ask support.\n2. 默默全扛，不声张，自己加班补上 — silent overwork.\n\nChoice 1 is best: transparent communication + reasonable support.\n\nBoard: M=35 Q=12, H=8 D=10 S=87 N=36 O=26 W=23 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_jBJ0ER1Sb5TLVb551EeB7252"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_b6YMhpXajMq25IQNlU9F5089", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":35,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":88,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":18,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":23,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"项目奖金分配你觉得不公\",\"description\":\"一个项目结项发奖金，你出力最多，分到的却和打酱油的人差不多，主导分配的同事明显厚此薄彼。你觉得很不公平。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"用项目中的具体贡献为依据，平和地找负责人或领导反映、争取合理调整\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"咽下不公、什么都不说，从此对项目寒了心\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"气不过，扬言下次项目摆烂、谁也别想用我\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_b6YMhpXajMq25IQNlU9F5089"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_K0rD8RDuinDXPKOtnEaE8851", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 用项目中的具体贡献为依据，平和地找负责人或领导反映、争取合理调整，理性争取公平。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=35: 项目奖金分配不公. Choices:\n1. 用具体贡献为依据，平和地找负责人或领导反映、争取合理调整 — professional.\n2. 咽下不公、什么都不说 — passive.\n3. 扬言摆烂 — bad.\n\nChoice 1.\n\nBoard: M=35 Q=12, H=8 D=10 S=88 N=36 O=26 W=23 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_K0rD8RDuinDXPKOtnEaE8851"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_YX0evfEYL7WefJXdDyxT6902", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":35,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":89,\"network\":36,\"level\":\"L4\",\"duration_in_level\":18,\"output\":26,\"wealth\":23,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"午餐技术分享是否报名主讲\",\"description\":\"组里午餐 Learn 缺下一期主讲，Topic 正好是你刚做的「回调幂等设计」。报名需准备 40 分钟 slide，本周排期已满。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"报名主讲\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"推荐更熟这块的小陈去讲\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"不报名专注交付\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_YX0evfEYL7WefJXdDyxT6902"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_SrD7xe10zSWkwruMPKLd6993", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 报名主讲午餐技术分享，把已完成的回调幂等设计转化为可见的专业曝光，直击\\\"只会忙不会赢\\\"。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=35: 午餐技术分享是否报名主讲. Choices:\n1. 报名主讲 — visibility/leadership, but busy week.\n2. 推荐更熟这块的小陈去讲 — give opportunity to other.\n3. 不报名专注交付 — focus.\n\nGiven the \"visible win\" gap and Leader's advice (\"产出和关系\"), presenting a tech talk is a visible win (Output/visibility) and builds reputation. But the week is full.\n\nHmm. Choice 1 gives visibility (addresses \"只会忙不会赢\"). Choice 3 protects delivery. Choice 2 is altruistic.\n\nGiven Output capped but visibility matters (Leader said visible wins), choice 1 could help. But busy week → risk to delivery/health (H=8).\n\nHmm. Let me weigh. The topic is \"你刚做的回调幂等设计\" — something I did. Presenting it = visible win. Given the recurring \"只会忙不会赢\" concern, a tech talk is a low-cost visibility boost. But the week is full.\n\nChoice 1 vs choice 3. Given the persistent visible-win gap and that this is a chance to showcase my work, choice 1 is good. The slide prep (40 min) is manageable.\n\nActually, given health at 8 and full schedule, choice 3 (focus on delivery) is safer. But choice 1 addresses the core gap.\n\nHmm. Let me think: the game likely rewards choice 1 (proactive visibility) given the recurring theme. Or choice 2 (generosity).\n\nI'll go with choice 1 — register to present, seizing a visible-win opportunity. Risk: could cost health/time. But it's the growth-oriented choice.\n\nHmm, but \"本周排期已满\" signals overload. And H=8. \n\nLet me consider choice 2 (推荐小陈): altruistic, builds relationship, but loses personal visibility.\n\nGiven the persistent \"visible win\" gap and that I should seize visibility opportunities, choice 1.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: I've been consistently picking the proactive/visible choices. Let me continue with choice 1.\n\nHmm, but health... Let me think about the tradeoff more concretely. Presenting a 40-min talk I've already done the work for (回调幂等设计) is low marginal effort and high visibility. It's a good ROI. Choice 1.\n\nBoard: M=35 Q=12, H=8 D=10 S=89 N=36 O=26 W=23 L=L4 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1.\n\nActually, hold on — I should consider whether choice 1 vs 3 matters for Output. Output is capped at 26. A tech talk might boost Network/Dignity/Skill rather than Output. Given visibility, likely Network/Dignity. Still valuable.\n\nGo with choice 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_SrD7xe10zSWkwruMPKLd6993"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_7SlBh0Bc0PSh1gYJcMQT9095", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":36,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":91,\"network\":34,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":25,\"wealth\":25,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"同事不断转嫁私活长链\",\"description\":\"同组的大伟特别会「找帮手」。今天让你帮他改两页 PPT，明天让你帮他跑个脚本，理由总是「你比我熟，几分钟的事」。起初你乐于助人，但渐渐发现，他把本属于自己的活越推越多，甚至开始把你的帮忙当成理所当然，自己却提前下班。今天他又发来一条：「兄弟，这个数据帮我整理下呗，我赶着接孩子。」\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"这次帮，但明确告诉他「以后这类活你得自己先做一版我再看」\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"委婉拒绝：「我手头也排满了，你先自己整，卡住了我再搭手」\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"继续默默接下，不想破坏关系\"}],\"events\":\"【半年谈话】直属 Leader 约你到小会议室，就过去半年的表现做一次一对一反馈：\\\\n\\\\nLeader 合上笔记本，语气明显缓和：「这半年你扛的事我都记着——关键节点没掉链子，跨组协调也有你的份。上面问部门骨干名单时，我第一个想到你。接下来继续保持节奏，有想法直接来找我，资源上我会帮你争取。」\\\\n\\\\n半年绩效奖金（A）：+1.0499999999999998\\\\n\\\\n本月基本工资到账：+0.7（L4）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\\\\n\\\\n晋升通知：半年组织评审通过，您已从 L4 晋升至 L5（技术专家 / 小组负责人）。\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_7SlBh0Bc0PSh1gYJcMQT9095"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=36 Q=12\nSTATE: H=7 D=10 S=91 N=34 O=25 W=25 L=L5 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1（新晋 L5）\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A（+1.05）；Leader\"关键节点没掉链子、跨组协调有你、部门骨干第一个想到你\"；已晋升 L5（技术专家/小组负责人）\nSTICKY: \"只会忙不会赢\"进展担忧（显著缓解）；健康偏低（7）；大伟转嫁私活需设边界\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2,N-2 after 主讲分享+奖金沟通；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=私活转嫁边界\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 reason=这次帮、但明确\"以后这类活你先做一版我再看\"，兼顾同事紧急需求（接孩子）又建立清晰边界，优于委婉拒绝（当下关系张力）或继续默默接下（被持续占便宜）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规边界沟通，无实质生存威胁。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_5vJFQzLoFbbfTMn0JIGx9605", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 这次帮大伟、但明确\\\"以后这类活你先做一版我再看\\\"，兼顾其紧急需求又建立清晰边界。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Promoted to L5! Half-year review A (+1.05). Leader very positive: \"关键节点没掉链子，跨组协调也有你的份... 上面问部门骨干名单时，我第一个想到你.\"\n\nState: M=36 Q=12, H=7 D=10 S=91 N=34 O=25 W=25 L=L5 E=0, duration_in_level=1.\n\nNow L5 → Output cap may be higher. Let me continue.\n\nEvent M=36: 同事不断转嫁私活. Choices:\n1. 这次帮，但明确告诉边界（以后自己先做一版我再看）— helps + sets boundary.\n2. 委婉拒绝：「我手头也排满了，你先自己整，卡住了我再搭手」— polite refusal with backup.\n3. 继续默默接下 — no boundary.\n\nChoice 1 or 2. Choice 1 helps this time but sets a firm boundary going forward. Choice 2 refuses this time but offers backup.\n\nGiven the pattern (大伟 takes advantage), setting a boundary is needed. Choice 1 (help but establish boundary) is constructive and maintains relationship. Choice 2 (decline but offer backup) is also fine.\n\nChoice 1 is good: helps now (he has to pick up kid) while establishing a clear future boundary. Balanced and humane.\n\nBoard: M=36 Q=12, H=7 D=10 S=91 N=34 O=25 W=25 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1.\n\nHealth at 7 — a bit low. Keep in mind. L5 now.\n\nLet me continue."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_5vJFQzLoFbbfTMn0JIGx9605"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_W2xL17Y9x1K50cyVLsIw9937", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":36,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":92,\"network\":35,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":25,\"wealth\":25,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":4},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"观察升职靠关系而非能力\",\"description\":\"你观察三年：升得最快的是贺帆——技术一般，但 KTV、球局、帮 Leader 接孩子从未缺席。你技术评分连年第一，晋升慢半拍。老周说「也要看综合」。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"学习投入非正式场合，控制底线\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"拒绝迎合，加倍技术产出\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"向 HRBP 反映晋升标准模糊\"},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"跳槽准备，减少投入\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_W2xL17Y9x1K50cyVLsIw9937"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_PRIxmjFm1wnwu7rEPUeU9060", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 学习投入非正式场合并控制底线，顺应\\\"综合\\\"评价现实、补强关系维度，优于拒绝迎合（晋升慢）或向HRBP反映（易树敌）或消极跳槽准备。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=36: 观察升职靠关系而非能力. Choices:\n1. 学习投入非正式场合，控制底线 — adapt, build relationships with boundaries.\n2. 拒绝迎合，加倍技术产出 — pure tech.\n3. 向 HRBP 反映晋升标准模糊 — escalate.\n4. 跳槽准备，减少投入 — disengage.\n\nGiven the reality that relationships matter (Leader emphasized \"产出和关系\"), and my Network has been a focus, choice 1 (invest in informal settings with boundaries) is pragmatic. Choice 2 (pure tech) ignores reality. Choice 3 (HRBP complaint) risky. Choice 4 (job hunt) disengages.\n\nChoice 1 is best: adapt to organizational reality while keeping boundaries.\n\nBoard: M=36 Q=12, H=7 D=10 S=92 N=35 O=25 W=25 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_PRIxmjFm1wnwu7rEPUeU9060"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_KcXZPtuGUSV5SQsgCeD90000", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":36,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":5,\"dignity\":9,\"skill\":92,\"network\":38,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":25,\"wealth\":25,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"观察升职靠关系而非能力\",\"description\":\"半年后贺帆再升，你获「协作」加分但仍慢。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"继续经营关系\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"回归技术路线\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_KcXZPtuGUSV5SQsgCeD90000"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Health 快速下滑（10→7→5），触发生存约束，转入稳定模式。\n\nBoard:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=36 Q=12\nSTATE: H=5 D=9 S=92 N=38 O=25 W=25 L=L5 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1（新晋 L5）\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A；已晋升 L5；贺帆靠关系再升，我获\"协作\"加分但仍慢\nSTICKY: 健康快速下滑（10→5，生存约束，需稳定）；关系投入推高 Network 但耗健康\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N+3,H-2,D-1 after 经营非正式场合；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=survival-stabilize P=S checkpoint=健康止损\nCANDIDATE: choice=2 reason=H 已降至 5 且快速下滑，转为回归技术路线、减少耗健康的社交投入，先稳住生存底线，优于继续经营关系（可能进一步拖垮健康）。\n\nRISK: ALLOW — 触及健康生存约束，全量复核；choice 2 为止损型选择。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_1uo03pFoApZY4Nt9XpBp7101", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=survival-stabilize P=S R=ALLOW X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] H已降至5且快速下滑，回归技术路线、减少耗健康的社交投入，先稳住生存底线。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Health dropped to 5! That's concerning. H=5, D=9. Health is getting low — this is approaching a survival constraint. The previous action (学习投入非正式场合) cost health (-2) and dignity (-1), and boosted network (+3). Health at 5 is now a material concern.\n\nEvent M=36 follow-up: 贺帆再升，你获\"协作\"加分但仍慢. Choices:\n1. 继续经营关系 — keep networking.\n2. 回归技术路线 — back to tech.\n\nBut my health is at 5 now. This is a survival concern. The rolling-planning says switch to stabilization (MODE S) for material public survival constraints. Health 5/10 is getting low and dropping fast (10→8→7→5). I should prioritize health recovery.\n\nBut the current event is a binary: continue relationships vs tech. Neither directly addresses health. Hmm.\n\nLet me think. H=5 is low. The next energy quarter (Q13) I'll invest in 健康恢复. But the immediate event choice: 继续经营关系 (which just cost health) vs 回归技术路线.\n\nGiven health is dropping due to relationship-building, and it's at 5, maybe I should be cautious. But the event is about career strategy.\n\nHmm. Given H=5, I want to avoid further health-draining activities. 回归技术路线 (choice 2) might reduce the health-draining networking. But the game rewards relationships.\n\nActually, the health drop came from the \"学习投入非正式场合\" action which had a health cost (late nights at KTV etc.). Choice 2 (回归技术路线) would avoid that.\n\nBut we just saw relationships matter for promotion. Hmm.\n\nLet me reconsider. Actually, the health drop to 5 is significant. I should treat this as a stabilization trigger. The next quarter I'll do 健康恢复.\n\nFor this event: choice 1 (继续经营关系) vs choice 2 (回归技术路线). Given health is dropping and I just got a \"协作\"加分, maybe balance. Hmm.\n\nActually, let me think about which is safer for health. Choice 1 (continue networking) likely continues health drain. Choice 2 (back to tech) might restore/preserve health. Given H=5, choice 2 is safer for survival.\n\nBut career-wise, choice 1 maintains the relationship momentum. Hmm.\n\nGiven H=5 and the risk of health collapse, I'll prioritize health: choice 2 (回归技术路线). Actually, but that might reduce Network gains...\n\nHmm. Let me think about the game's health mechanics. H=5/10. Earlier H dropped to 7-8 and recovered with rest. The failure mode \"健康崩溃（眼前一黑）\" presumably at H=0. So H=5 isn't critical yet, but the trend is bad.\n\nI think the prudent choice given H=5 is to reduce health-draining activities. But the binary doesn't offer a health option. Between the two, 回归技术路线 (choice 2) likely involves less late-night socializing → less health drain, and I still have solid Skill.\n\nHmm, but the game seems to reward relationships. Let me reconsider: maybe the \"correct\" answer is to continue building relationships (choice 1) because that's what advances careers, and I should just manage health via energy actions.\n\nUgh. Let me decide based on risk. Given H=5, I'll pick choice 2 (回归技术路线) to protect health, OR choice 1 to maintain career momentum.\n\nActually — let me reconsider the framing. The event says \"半年后贺帆再升，你获「协作」加分但仍慢.\" This suggests relationship-building is paying off but slowly. The choice is whether to continue or return to tech.\n\nGiven the game rewards a balanced approach and my health is now a concern, maybe the best is to continue but the game wants me to... hmm.\n\nLet me think about the health cost source. The -2 health likely came from the networking action. If I choose choice 1 (继续经营关系), health might drop further. If H goes to 3 or lower, risk of collapse.\n\nGiven H=5 is a real warning, I'll choose choice 2 (回归技术路线) to stabilize health. This is the MODE=S stabilization response to a material survival constraint (declining health).\n\nHmm, but wait — will choice 2 actually restore health? Unknown. But it should avoid further drain.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether this is truly a \"material public survival constraint\". H=5/10 is halfway. The game's failure at H=0. Is 5 \"material\"? It's a notable decline. Given the rapid drop (10→5 over a few months), I'll treat it as a stabilization trigger.\n\nDecision: choice 2 (回归技术路线), prioritizing health/stability. And next quarter, invest in 健康恢复.\n\nHmm, but this might tank Network. Let me think... Actually, maybe choice 1 (继续经营关系) is what the game rewards and health recovers via energy actions. \n\nArgh. Let me just go with the health-conscious choice: choice 2. Given the rapid health decline, protecting survival is paramount (rolling-planning: stabilization for material survival constraints).\n\nWait, but actually — hmm. Let me reconsider. The health drop might have been from a different cause. The observe before showed H=7 (after 私活边界 + earlier). Then after \"学习投入非正式场合\" → H=5, N=38 (+3). So yes, that action cost health.\n\nIf I continue (choice 1), more health loss. If I switch to tech (choice 2), likely health stable/gain.\n\nGiven H=5, I'll pick choice 2.\n\nHmm, but the career strategy emphasizes relationships. However, survival first. Let me go with choice 2.\n\nActually, let me reconsider one more time. Perhaps the game intends that you can't purely avoid relationships. But given health at 5, the immediate risk of choosing choice 1 (further drain) is health collapse. I'll choose choice 2 for safety.\n\nHmm, but what if choice 2 also has downsides (career stall)? Given health is the survival floor, I prioritize it.\n\nDecision: choice 2 (回归技术路线). Risk: ALLOW (health/survival constraint touched → MODE=S). Actually risk-review: material survival constraint (health 5 and declining). I'll mark R=ALLOW.\n\nHmm, let me reconsider — is choice 2 the one that protects health? The event is about career strategy, not explicitly health. But 回归技术路线 implies less late-night socializing → health protection.\n\nOK, choice 2. Let me also note MODE=S now.\n\nBoard: M=36 Q=12, H=5 D=9 S=92 N=38 O=25 W=25 L=L5 E=0. STICKY: health declining (10→5), survival concern.\n\nLet me act with choice 2.\n\nActually, hold on. Let me reconsider the game's intent once more. The event title \"观察升职靠关系而非能力\" and the follow-up. The two choices: continue relationships vs back to tech. Given the game has shown relationships matter for promotion (Leader said \"综合\"), and my Network is a growth area... but health is dropping.\n\nHmm, I worry choice 2 might be the \"giving up on relationships\" path that stalls career. But health first.\n\nGiven H=5, I'll go with choice 2 to protect health. Then next quarter, heavy health recovery.\n\nFinal: choice 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_1uo03pFoApZY4Nt9XpBp7101"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_lO18J5ZTeQd2Ns7Ycb9A5144", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":36,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":5,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":94,\"network\":38,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":27,\"wealth\":25,\"energy\":3},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":3,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_lO18J5ZTeQd2Ns7Ycb9A5144"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=36 Q=12\nSTATE: H=5 D=10 S=94 N=38 O=27 W=25 L=L5 E=3\nTENURE: duration_in_level=1（L5，Output 上限已提升，触顶解除）\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A；已晋升 L5\nSTICKY: 健康快速下滑至 5（生存约束，需优先恢复）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（S+2,O+2,D+1 after 回归技术路线；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=survival-stabilize P=S QUARTER_INTENT=本季 3 体力全投健康恢复，把 H 从 5 拉回安全线\nCANDIDATE: choice=6 (健康恢复) 起手 reason=H=5 为生存约束，健康恢复每点 +2 Health、边际价值最高。\n\nRISK: PASS — 健康恢复为纯增益，无风险。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_2vtfseh2E5c3Ub3Yx2zu3089", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 6, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=survival-stabilize P=S R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:H=5生存约束，3体力全投健康恢复。第1点：健康恢复(H+2)。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Health at 5, and Output rose to 27 (cap lifted at L5!). Skill 94, Network 38.\n\nNow quarterly energy, MODE=S (stabilize health). Priority: 健康恢复 to fix H=5. Use 3 energy on health recovery: 健康恢复 x3 → H+6 = 11 → capped at 10. That fully restores health.\n\nActually H=5, 健康恢复 gives +2 each → 3x = +6 → H=10 (capped). Good.\n\nAlternatively 健康恢复 x2 (H+4 → 9) + something else. But health is the constraint; restore to 10.\n\nLet me do 健康恢复 x3 → H=10.\n\nQUARTER_INTENT (MODE S): 3 体力全投健康恢复，止住健康下滑至安全线。\n\nExecute choice 6 three times."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_2vtfseh2E5c3Ub3Yx2zu3089"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_NvS3eSPrKjgLcUylf22P3881", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":36,\"current_quarter\":12,\"current_year\":3},\"status\":{\"health\":7,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":94,\"network\":38,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":1,\"output\":27,\"wealth\":25,\"energy\":2},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消