ty. Choice 2 (private coordination + buffer + contingency) maintains relationship but leaves risk unaddressed officially.\n\nGiven the risk is about to be exposed in a high-level report, transparency is important. Choice 1 formally escalates — this is the responsible choice (visibility of risk). It also protects me from being blamed for the delay.\n\nHmm, but escalating could damage the peer relationship. However, the peer won't update the official schedule, which puts me at risk.\n\nGiven the game rewards transparency/visibility and protecting oneself with facts, choice 1 seems right. Earlier I escalated a dependency risk (per the summary: \"escalated dependency risk\"). So consistent with pattern → choice 1.\n\nBoard: M=39 Q=13, H=10 D=10 S=102 N=41 O=31 W=28 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS (or ALLOW). Escalation touches relationships but is the transparent choice. PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_KEwJ1sHSdLM90WFuOm5g5307"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_uSt94p5oyIOJmGVDpzaW7567", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":39,\"current_quarter\":13,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":102,\"network\":39,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":4,\"output\":32,\"wealth\":28,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"依赖团队延期是否公开升级\",\"description\":\"高层介入后对方团队被迫承诺硬性 deadline，但 Tech Lead 私下表示\\'从此不再有非正式的灵活空间\\'。合作氛围恶化。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"主动与对方 Tech Lead 沟通