null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":8},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度体力行动分配\",\"description\":\"新的一个季度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":3,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_1p3AL2tutoFQSG68iyyI3762"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=39 Q=13\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=102 N=40 O=32 W=28 L=L5 E=3\nTENURE: duration_in_level=4\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A；已晋升 L5；Output 上限提升、恢复增长\nSTICKY: 无重大未决风险；健康稳定（10）\nEFFECTS: MIXED（O+1,N+1 after 依赖升级善后；起因不可分离）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A QUARTER_INTENT=Output 恢复可增长，本季 3 体力全投 Output（可见成果）\nCANDIDATE: choice=7 (准备汇报材料) 起手 reason=O+1/D+1、每点体力产出最高且无健康代价，优于高强度工作（H-1 且有风险累积）。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_YASo0DBdvlOERCTO5yTs5824", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 7, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:Output恢复增长，3体力全投可见成果。第1点：准备汇报材料(O+1,D+1)，无健康代价。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Quarterly energy. State: H=10 D=10 S=102 N=40 O=32 W=28 E=3.\n\nOutput cap lifted at L5 (growing). Output 32, Skill 102, Network 40.\n\nNow Output is growable again. Given the gap is visible wins/Output, invest in Output. But 高强度工作 costs H-1,D-1. \n\nOptions:\n- 准备汇报材料 (1): O+1, D+1 — no health cost.\n- 高强度工作 (2): O+2, H-1, D-1.\n- 技能学习 (2): S+1, H-1.\n- 人脉维护 (1): N+1, D+1.\n\nGiven Output is the main gap and growable, maximize Output with minimal health cost: 准备汇报材料 x3 → O+3, D+3(capped). No health cost. \n\nOr 高强度工作 (2, O+2) + 准备汇报材料 (1, O+1) → O+3, H-1, D-1+1=0. Same O+3 but with H-1. So 准备汇报材料 x3 is better (no health cost).\n\nSo 3x 准备汇报材料 → O+3.\n\nQUARTER_INTENT: Output 恢复可增长，3 体力全投 Output（准备汇报材料）。\n\nExecute choice 7 three times.\n\nLet me proceed."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_YASo0DBdvlOERCTO5yTs5824"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_xSbjscn9B2W1qtu2mqsG1437", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_mon