asonable balance. Hmm.\n\nThe game likely rewards the balanced choice 3 (折中). I'll pick choice 3.\n\nLet me act."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_OGKPOQRA2rImemYhXmDf8209"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_WTe6h0t5jbFWwRvVwihH8375", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":40,\"current_quarter\":14,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":105,\"network\":44,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":5,\"output\":37,\"wealth\":29,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"午饭跟同事吃还是回家吃\",\"description\":\"折中运行一个月，Leader 没再提「融入」。你在饭局得知老吴的项目要合并到你模块，提前有了准备。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"保持当前节奏\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"进一步增加饭局频率争取曝光\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_WTe6h0t5jbFWwRvVwihH8375"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_os101bAzKSN1oEVYCPM83362", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 保持当前折中节奏，既维持团队融入与情报网又保留午休精力，不冒进增加饭局以免耗健康。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=40 follow-up: 折中有效. Choices:\n1. 保持当前节奏 — keep balance.\n2. 进一步增加饭局频率争取曝光 — more socializing.\n\nGiven the balance is working (got intel, Leader stopped mentioning), keep the current rhythm (choice 1). Choice 2 risks health/energy drain (we saw health d