approve (risky, code has issues).\n\nGiven HR pushes \"心理安全\" and group culture is direct, choice 2 (提问式引导) balances: helps the new person learn while being psychologically safe. Choice 1 is direct (fits culture but harsh). Choice 3 approves bad code (bad).\n\nHmm. The design issue is significant (\"明显设计问题\"). Choice 1 (直接指出并标注必须修改) ensures quality. Choice 2 (引导) is kinder.\n\nGiven \"心理安全\" push and it's a new person's first MR, choice 2 seems balanced and good for the new person's growth. But quality must be ensured — choice 2 might not block.\n\nActually choice 2 \"用提问引导他自己意识到问题\" — this still gets the issue fixed through dialogue. Good for development and psychological safety.\n\nChoice 3 (Approve + IM) approves a flawed MR — risky.\n\nI'll pick choice 2 — Socratic guidance (balances quality, learning, psychological safety). \n\nBoard: M=41 Q=14, H=10 D=10 S=107 N=47 O=38 W=30 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 2. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_ceOeh706TNOQaj6xwQVq7974"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_nuUM0pl1gfv0C2buHNNV5041", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":41,\"current_quarter\":14,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":108,\"network\":49,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":6,\"output\":37,\"wealth\":30,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":3},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"领导暗示你资历该带人了\",\"description\":\"领导半开玩笑地点你：『你在技术上也算资深了，是不是该考虑带带人、往上走一走？老做一线也不是长久之计。』话里带着对你『该转型了』的期待。你怎么回应这份暗示？\"},\"choices