"content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_3TO9mdm2CfMNFPffTKmN0623"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_ChDtshEaZe01EBFqCKvN9950", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":42,\"current_quarter\":14,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":111,\"network\":52,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":37,\"wealth\":32,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"年度团建组织者报名抉择\",\"description\":\"部门今年的年度团建需要从各组选一位「内部组织者」，负责前期调研团队偏好、敲定形式（户外 / 聚餐 / 桌游）、对接 HR 行政、当天主持。这个角色和 OKR 完全无关，但成果直接影响整个部门 80 多人那两天的体验，是 Leader 们公开会看到的「软实力曝光位」。Leader 在群里问谁主动报名。你最近手头有一个排期项目，承担组织者会让你接下来三周每天多花 1-2 小时在团建准备上。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"主动报名担任组织者\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"不报名，把精力留给手头排期项目\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_ChDtshEaZe01EBFqCKvN9950"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_loRJ6DkVBnjBKblbVhsN5832", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 主动报名担任团建组织者，抓住 Leader 公开可见的软实力曝光位、强化\\\"关系与影响力\\\"维度。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=42: 年度团建组织者报名. Choices:\n1. 主动报名担任组织者 — visible soft-power exposure, but 3 weeks of extra 1-2h/day.\n2. 不报名，把精力留给手头排期项目 — focus.\n\nH is 10 (healthy now). The role is \"软实力曝光位\" visible to Leaders — aligns with visible-win goal and Leader's \"把功夫花在关系上\". But 3 weeks of extra time, and I have a project.\n\nHmm. Given health is 10 and the visible exposure is valuable (Leader sees it), and it aligns with \"关系\" emphasis... but time cost could hurt health/output.\n\nChoice 1 offers visibility/leadership. Choice 2 protects the project.\n\nGiven my pattern of seizing visible opportunities and the emphasis on relationships/visibility, choice 1 seems aligned. But the time cost (3 weeks, 1-2h/day) is significant and could hurt health.\n\nHmm. Given health is now 10 (recovered) and the project is \"排期\" (scheduled, not necessarily critical), and this is a public soft-power exposure visible to Leaders... I'll pick choice 1.\n\nActually, let me reconsider — the earlier over-socializing cost health. Adding 3 weeks of 1-2h/day could drain. But the exposure value is high, and it's temporary (3 weeks).\n\nGiven the game rewards visible wins and leadership, and health is 10, I'll choose choice 1.\n\nBoard: M=42 Q=14, H=10 D=10 S=111 N=52 O=37 W=32 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1.\n\nHmm, but wait — \"承担组织者会让你接下来三周每天多花 1-2 小时\" — that's a big ask. And I have a project. This could hurt both. But the exposure...\n\nLet me weigh: The recurring theme is that visible wins/relationships matter for advancement (I got L5 partly from \"跨组协调\"). This is a Leader-visible soft-power role. Worth it.\n\nChoice 1.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether the game might reward choice 2 (focus on delivery) as the \"professional\" answer. Hmm. But the framing \"Leader 们公开会看到的软实力曝光位\" strongly signals it's a career opportunity.\n\nI'll go with choice 1.\n\nLet me act."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_loRJ6DkVBnjBKblbVhsN5832"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_s7ThIZuNUG1ctZy4WaQF8320", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\"