action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_s7ThIZuNUG1ctZy4WaQF8320"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=42 Q=14\nSTATE: H=8 D=10 S=112 N=54 O=35 W=32 L=L5 E=3\nTENURE: duration_in_level=7\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A（+1.5）；Leader\"能扛事、把功夫花在产出和关系上\"\nSTICKY: 团建组织者投入致健康下滑（10→8）；无重大未决风险\nEFFECTS: MIXED（N+2,H-2,O-2 after 团建组织者；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A QUARTER_INTENT=健康回补至 10，其余投 Output/Network\nCANDIDATE: choice=6 (健康恢复) 起手 reason=H 降至 8，先回补健康守住底线。\n\nRISK: PASS — 健康恢复纯增益。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_M5hLw2Gt4uDPW0DmLr6W2481", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 6, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:健康回补+产出/关系。第1点：健康恢复(H+2)，H降至8先回补至安全线。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Health dropped to 8 (from the 团建组织者 commitment). Energy 3. \n\nGiven H=8 (dropped again), and Output growing (35). Let me allocate: restore health somewhat + invest.\n\nOptions:\n- 健康恢复 (1): H+2 → 10\n- 准备汇报材料 (1): O+1\n- 技能学习 (2): S+1, H-1\n- 人脉维护 (1): N+1\n\nGiven H=8, let me do 健康恢复 (1) + 准备汇报材料 (1) + 人脉维护 (1) → H+2=10, O+1, N+1. Total 3 energy. Balanced and safe.\n\nActually, 健康恢复 brings H to 10; then O+1 and N+1. Good.\n\nQUARTER_INTENT: H=8 需回补，同时兼顾 Output/Network。\n\nLet me do:\n1. 健康恢复 (choice 6)\n2. 准备汇报材料 (choice 7)\n3. 人脉维护 (choice 3)\n\nExecute choice 6 first."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_M5hLw2Gt4uDPW0DmLr6W2481"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_3edliRpDzbmBiS0d9Faq3710", "type": "function", "function": {"name":