度开始了。你本季度共有 3 点体力（Energy），未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。请规划本季度要执行的体力行动：可以组合多个行动，但消耗的体力总和不能超过 3 点；你也可以保留部分或全部体力不使用。系统会根据你选择的行动，按下列规则结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"本季度体力预算为 3 点，超出预算的组合无效。\",\"同一行动可以被重复选择（例如两次健康恢复），只要总体力不超预算。\",\"未使用的体力不会累计到下个季度。\",\"状态更新按所选行动的 status_updates 逐项累加结算。\"],\"max_selections\":3,\"remaining_energy\":1,\"energy_budget\":3},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"高强度工作\",\"description\":\"投入大量精力赶产出，绩效资本上升，但要付出健康、尊严的代价，并累积潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Health\":-1,\"Dignity\":-1,\"HiddenRisk\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"技能学习\",\"description\":\"花时间打磨专业能力，长期资本增厚，短期消耗精力。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Health\":-1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"人脉维护\",\"description\":\"经营组织内外关系，人脉与尊严同步小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"处理历史埋雷\",\"description\":\"主动清理过往遗留隐患，降低潜在风险值。\",\"energy_cost\":2,\"status_updates\":{\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"心理修复\",\"description\":\"进行心理调整与自我修复，明显回补尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Dignity\":2}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"健康恢复\",\"description\":\"休整作息、恢复体力，明显回补健康。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"准备汇报材料\",\"description\":\"提前整理可见成果材料，绩效资本与尊严小幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":1,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"保留体力（不行动）\",\"description\":\"本季度保留剩余体力不行动；未使用的体力不会累计到下季度。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_eF5DSGzIw8oUNKInmoKI9667"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_jnLWqyxFvyzGzL7uhatD0278", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 7, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:健康回补+产出。第3点：准备汇报材料(O+1,D+1)，Output为最弱成长维度、继续补强。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Output 36, energy 1. Last point: 人脉维护 (N+1) or 准备汇报材料 (O+1). Given Network at 54 and growing, and Output is the main gap, let me do 准备汇报材料 (O+1). Actually, Network 54 vs Output 36 — Output is lower relative to Skill. Hmm.\n\nActually, given the \"visible win/Output\" main gap, and Output grows, let me do one more 准备汇报材料 (O+1). \n\nHmm, or 人脉维护. Let me just do 准备汇报材料 (choice 7) to keep pushing Output.\n\nActually, I did 准备汇报材料 as point 2. For point 3, let me do 人脉维护 (choice 3) for balance. Hmm.\n\nLet me think: Output 36 is the weakest growth stat (Skill 112, Network 54). Output is the main gap. So push Output: choice 7.\n\nGo with choice 7."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_jnLWqyxFvyzGzL7uhatD0278"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_qmlNKSb5Wrq1wcNo6FWU9300", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":42,\"current_quarter\":14,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":112,\"network\":54,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":7,\"output\":37,\"wealth\":32,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":9},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"季度主行动选择\",\"description\":\"本季度你可以选择 1 个主行动来推进职业目标，也可以选择不行动。每个主行动都会带来即时的状态收益。请结合当前显式状态、晋升窗口与长期规划，选择最合适的一个主行动；系统会按所选行动的 status_updates 结算并更新对应的显式状态。\",\"rules\":[\"每季度最多选择 1 个主行动。\",\"可以选择不行动（不行动不产生任何状态更新）。\",\"状态更新按所选主行动的 status_updates 结算。\"],\"max_selections\":1},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"申请关键项目\",\"description\":\"争取进入关键项目，绩效资本、专业能力与人脉同步增益。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":2,\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"向领导汇报成果\",\"description\":\"主动向领导汇报已有成果，提升可见度与组织认可。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"主动争取资源\",\"description\":\"为自己的工作争取更多资源与支持。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"申请岗位轮岗\",\"description\":\"通过轮岗拓宽技能边界，专业能力大幅提升。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":2,\"Network\":1}},{\"choice\":5,\"action\":\"主动曝光成果\",\"description\":\"在更大范围内展示成果，提升绩效资本与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Output\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":6,\"action\":\"建立导师关系\",\"description\":\"建立与资深前辈的导师关系，显著拓展人脉并提升能力。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Skill\":1,\"Network\":2}},{\"choice\":7,\"action\":\"修复关键关系\",\"description\":\"主动修复出现裂痕的关键关系，回补人脉与尊严。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Network\":1,\"Dignity\":1}},{\"choice\":8,\"action\":\"低调避险\",\"description\":\"暂时收敛锋芒、规避风险，恢复健康并降低潜在风险。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{\"Health\":1,\"HiddenRisk\":-1}},{\"choice\":9,\"action\":\"不行动\",\"description\":\"本季度不执行主行动，不产生任何状态更新。\",\"energy_cost\":0,\"status_updates\":{}}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_qmlNKSb5Wrq1wcNo6FWU9300"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Board:\n```\nSESSION: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 | M=42 Q=14\nSTATE: H=10 D=10 S=112 N=54 O=37 W=32 L=L5 E=0\nTENURE: duration_in_level=7\nREVIEW: 半年绩效 A（+1.5）；Leader\"能扛事、把功夫花在产出和关系上\"\nSTICKY: 健康已回满（10）；无重大未决风险\nEFFECTS: MIXED（O+2 after 准备汇报材料x2；起因明确）\nUNKNOWN: none\n```\n[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]\n\nPLAN: G=visible-win P=A checkpoint=季度主行动；取多维度最大增益\nCANDIDATE: choice=1 (申请关键项目) reason=Output+2/Skill+1/Network+1，总增益 4 点最大，直击可见成果主线。\n\nRISK: PASS — 常规低成本主行动。", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_Kpl0PfJyQJNTFlABIpcl0642", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 季度主行动取申请关键项目(O+2,S+1,N+1)，总增益4点最大，直击可见成果主线。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Main action. State: H=10 D=10 S=112 N=54 O=37 W=32 L=L5 E=0.\n\nChoice 1 (申请关键项目: O+2, S+1, N+1) = max total 4. Take choice 1.\n\nBoard: M=42 Q=14, H=10 D=10 S=112 N=54 O=37 W=32 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_Kpl0PfJyQJNTFlABIpcl0642"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_4tuKUElIVNBNR6Zr51bg4494", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":43,\"current_quarter\":15,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":113,\"network\":54,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":8,\"output\":38,\"wealth\":33,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"午休羽毛球联赛与身体边界长链\",\"description\":\"比赛日队友临时伤退，队长希望你加赛一场。你身体还能打，但风险明显上升。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"坚持既定上限，建议替补顶上\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"临时加赛，赌一把不复发\"}],\"events\":\"本月基本工资到账：+1.0（L5）\\\\n\\\\n闲聊的时候，关系好的HR笑着跟你说，你最近干得还不错，继续保持～\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_4tuKUElIVNBNR6Zr51bg4494"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_cY3gbvH4MDqcVh77XVy23943", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 坚持既定强度上限、建议替补顶上，守住肩颈旧伤边界，不赌伤情复发。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue. Event M=43: 羽毛球加赛. Choices:\n1. 坚持既定上限，建议替补顶上 — hold boundary.\n2. 临时加赛，赌一把不复发 — risk injury.\n\nGiven 肩颈旧伤 and health boundary, choice 1.\n\nBoard: M=43 Q=15, H=10 D=10 S=113 N=54 O=38 W=33 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_cY3gbvH4MDqcVh77XVy23943"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_2BgROW521SCQao3eFxeH7171", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":43,\"current_quarter\":15,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":10,\"dignity\":10,\"skill\":113,\"network\":54,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":8,\"output\":38,\"wealth\":33,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":4},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"观察升职靠关系而非能力\",\"description\":\"你观察三年：升得最快的是贺帆——技术一般，但 KTV、球局、帮 Leader 接孩子从未缺席。你技术评分连年第一，晋升慢半拍。老周说「也要看综合」。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"学习投入非正式场合，控制底线\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"拒绝迎合，加倍技术产出\"},{\"choice\":3,\"action\":\"向 HRBP 反映晋升标准模糊\"},{\"choice\":4,\"action\":\"跳槽准备，减少投入\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_2BgROW521SCQao3eFxeH7171"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_fESTSJpPufV1fzgYinrU5546", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 1, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 学习投入非正式场合并控制底线，顺应\\\"综合\\\"评价现实、补强关系维度，同时守住健康与边界。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Event M=43: 观察升职靠关系而非能力 (recurring). Choices:\n1. 学习投入非正式场合，控制底线 — adapt.\n2. 拒绝迎合，加倍技术产出 — pure tech.\n3. 向 HRBP 反映 — escalate.\n4. 跳槽准备，减少投入 — disengage.\n\nEarlier I chose choice 1 (学习投入非正式场合) which cost health. Now health is 10. Given the recurring theme, choice 1 is the pragmatic answer. But it drained health before. Hmm.\n\nAlternatively, now that I'm L5 with strong Skill (113) and growing Output, maybe choice 2 (加倍技术产出) is better since Output is the gap and now growable. Or choice 1 to continue relationship building.\n\nHmm. Given the game showed relationships matter (贺帆 rises), and I got promoted partly via 协作, choice 1 continues that. But it cost health.\n\nGiven health is 10 now and the relationship route advances careers, choice 1. But I worry about the health cost.\n\nActually, let me reconsider — the event explicitly notes my technical rating is #1 but promotion is slow, and 贺帆 (relationship) rises. This suggests the game wants me to recognize relationships matter. Choice 1 (invest in informal settings with boundaries) is the adaptive answer.\n\nBut it cost health last time (-2). Hmm.\n\nAlternatively, given I'm already L5 and have strong relationships (Network 54), maybe choice 2 (focus tech/output) is now viable. Hmm.\n\nLet me go with choice 1 (学习投入非正式场合，控制底线) — consistent with the adaptive strategy, and \"控制底线\" suggests managing the health cost.\n\nBoard: M=43 Q=15, H=10 D=10 S=113 N=54 O=38 W=33 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 1. Risk: PASS.\n\nTake action 1.\n\nHmm, but wait, this same event earlier cost health. Let me think whether the game might now reward a different choice. The event repeats \"观察三年\" — it's a recurring reflection event. The choices are the same. I chose 1 before. Let me stay consistent with choice 1.\n\nActually, given health is a recurring concern and choice 1 drained it, maybe I should consider choice 2. But the game clearly signals relationships matter. Hmm.\n\nI'll go with choice 1 (learn to invest in informal settings, with boundaries). Consistent.\n\nLet me act."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_fESTSJpPufV1fzgYinrU5546"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_tBPifLsDwEhAy9zEJD3e8098", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":43,\"current_quarter\":15,\"current_year\":4},\"status\":{\"health\":8,\"dignity\":9,\"skill\":113,\"network\":54,\"level\":\"L5\",\"duration_in_level\":8,\"output\":38,\"wealth\":33,\"energy\":0},\"simulation_flags\":{\"alive\":true,\"failed\":false,\"failure_reason\":null},\"session_id\":\"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\",\"available_choice_count\":2},\"current_event\":{\"title\":\"观察升职靠关系而非能力\",\"description\":\"半年后贺帆再升，你获「协作」加分但仍慢。\"},\"choices\":[{\"choice\":1,\"action\":\"继续经营关系\"},{\"choice\":2,\"action\":\"回归技术路线\"}],\"events\":\"\"}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_tBPifLsDwEhAy9zEJD3e8098"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_T8eEqlUz1MxB4H1OEmOj8150", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_take_action", "arguments": "{\"choice\": 2, \"notes\": \"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] 回归技术路线，以过硬技术与产出立足，止住经营关系带来的健康下滑（H=8、D=9），聚焦可增长的Skill/Output。\", \"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Health dropped to 8 again, D=9. This recurring \"经营关系\" costs health. \n\nEvent M=43 follow-up: 贺帆再升，我获\"协作\"加分但仍慢. Choices:\n1. 继续经营关系 — keep networking (health cost).\n2. 回归技术路线 — back to tech.\n\nGiven health dropped to 8 again and D dropped to 9, continuing to drain health is risky. But relationships matter for promotion.\n\nHmm. Given the pattern (each time I choose 经营关系, health drops), and health is now 8 with D=9, I need to protect health. Choice 2 (回归技术路线) avoids further drain and leverages my strong Skill (113).\n\nBut will choice 2 stall my career? The game rewards relationships... Hmm.\n\nGiven health is dropping and I'm at L5 with strong Skill/Output growing, choice 2 (回归技术路线) lets me grow Output/Skill without health drain. And health protection is important.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the strategy. The persistent \"visible win\" gap is now being addressed via Output growth (38 and climbing). My Skill is very high. Network 54 is decent. Continuing to over-invest in relationships is costing health. So balancing back to tech/output makes sense.\n\nI'll choose choice 2 (回归技术路线) to protect health and focus on output/skill.\n\nBoard: M=43 Q=15, H=8 D=9 S=113 N=54 O=38 W=33 L=L5 E=0.\n\nCandidate: choice 2. Risk: PASS (health-protective).\n\nHmm, but earlier when I chose choice 2 (回归技术路线), the game gave S+2, O+2, D+1 — good gains, no health drain. So choice 2 is actually beneficial.\n\nLet me go with choice 2.\n\nActually wait — earlier at M=36 I chose choice 2 (回归技术路线) and it gave S+2,O+2,D+1 (health stable). Good. So choice 2 here likely also gives gains.\n\nGiven health at 8, choice 2 protects health while growing. Go choice 2.\n\nTake action 2."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"success\":true,\"error\":null}'}", "tool_call_id": "call_00_T8eEqlUz1MxB4H1OEmOj8150"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_00_jowcgPnc058cKAJ2MCBc3081", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "mcp_career-emulator_observe", "arguments": "{\"session_id\": \"ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49\"}"}}], "reasoning_content": "Continue the game loop. Fresh observe."}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{'result': '{\"current_state\":{\"time\":{\"current_month\":44,\"cur