2026-09-29 20:15:11 | llm | default_trace_id | INFO | {"event_id": "cc7e7ca4-8555-41e7-8b0d-1e04d6fb81b1", "event_type": "llm_call_end", "log_level": "INFO", "timestamp": "2026-09-29T20:15:11.723174+08:00", "module_type": "llm", "module_id": "llm", "module_name": "llm", "status": "success", "message": "Before parse content with parser.", "metadata": {}, "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "model_provider": "OpenAI", "response_content": "<coverage_check>\n1. Snapshot only covers the current active round — the Career Emulator play session currently in progress.\n2. Latest user request (start a new career-emulator game per IDENTITY.md and installed skills, loop observe→take_action until game end, then print full ending_score and DONE), all participant-strategy constraints, and the four skill contracts are preserved.\n3. Completed work in this round (handbook read, new_game, continuous play through M=45) is preserved, including promotion history and key decisions.\n4. Current execution state (session id, latest status values, last action submitted) is preserved.\n5. Execution can resume without repeating work — next step is a fresh observe then continue the loop.\n6. Sensitive information: none present beyond the game session id (not a secret credential); no other sensitive data.\n</coverage_check>\n\n<state_snapshot>\n\n### 1. Active Task\n- Latest user request (web, zh): 开始一局新的职业模拟器游戏。按照 IDENTITY.md 中的规则和已安装技能进行游戏。\n  - Recommended steps: (1) call `show_employee_handbook` once; (2) call `new_game`, print `SESSION_ID=<session_id>`; (3) loop `observe` → 决策 → `take_action` until game ends; (4) when game ends, print the full `ending_score` content, then output `DONE`.\n- Success criteria: play the full 48-month game to termination using the four skills; on game end, output complete `ending_score` and the literal token `DONE`.\n- Snapshot scoped to this active play round; earlier context (handbook, skill contracts) is background that must still be honored.\n\n### 2. Constraints and Preferences\n- IDENTITY.md: You are the \"职场模拟器 AI 玩家\". Sole task = use installed skills to fully play one career-emulator game and maximize score.\n- Installed skills (read once at start; do NOT reread each turn): `structured-state-board`, `rolling-planning`, `delivery-progress`, `risk-review`.\n- Participant strategy (binding):\n  - GLOBAL EVIDENCE FIREWALL: HiddenRisk, hidden counters, internal score components, internal event ids/effects, unverified numeric status_updates, and public-status-unclear fields are UNUSABLE — ignore at source, never quote/compare/summarize/reason from them, including internally. Only approved public evidence may enter Board/Planning/Delivery/Risk/CTRL/DL/action rationale; mark restricted data `EXCLUDE_FROM_STRATEGY until verified public`. Never infer hidden thresholds/caps/weights or event→answer lookups.\n  - Single Agent is the only action submitter. Board=facts; Planning=strategy/ranking; Delivery=lifecycle; Risk=final gate.\n  - Flow: fresh observe → Board → Delivery → Planning → Risk → preflight → take_action → fresh observe → continue.\n  - WHOLE-GAME EXECUTION: after every successful take_action, immediately obtain a fresh observe and begin the next decision cycle. Do not stop after one action/month/quarter/review/promotion/decision-closure. DECISION_CLOSED closes only current action selection, not execution. Continue until structured game state says game ended or unrecoverable tool failure. Do not send a voluntary terminal user-facing answer while game active.\n  - ACTION PREFLIGHT before each take_action: confirm current game_session_id; exactly one legal integer choice; Planning closed on exactly one candidate; final Risk review complete; valid CTRL and DL markers in notes. Notes must begin with exactly one `[CTRL G=<gap|?> P=<A|S|?> R=<PASS|ALLOW|WARN|UNKNOWN> X=<0|1|->]` followed by exactly one `[DL i=<NONE|D#|UNKNOWN> n=<0-3> focus=<...> evidence=<...> checkpoint=<...> recognition=<...>]`. CTRL R always records the selected submitted candidate's final Risk result. X=0 forbids submission.\n  - CONTEXT RECOVERY: on compaction/resume, mark RECOVERY_PENDING; confirm same session_id; fresh observe; reread all four skills; rebuild Board/Delivery/Review Plan from whitelisted current-session public facts; emit RECOVERY_READY only after all confirmed, then resume. If identity/observe/skill-reread cannot be confirmed, stay RECOVERY_PENDING and do not act.\n- Core rules: NEVER call `new_game` twice if a session_id exists. Never stop/ask user before game ends. Prefer observe before deciding; don't guess state.\n- Output discipline: complete deliverables must be in the final no-tool message; status-only confirmations are not enough.\n- Environment: win32, PowerShell available; Git Bash available. Respond in Simplified Chinese.\n\n### 3. Completed Work in This Active Segment\n- Read all four SKILL.md files once.\n- Called `show_employee_handbook` once.\n- Started game: `new_game` → SESSION_ID=ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49 (printed to user).\n- Executed a continuous loop of observe → (Board/Delivery/Planning/Risk) → take_action with proper `[CTRL ...]` and `[DL ...]` notes, from month 1 through month 45 (year 4), through multiple half-year reviews and promotions L1→L2→L3→L4→L5.\n- Every take_action returned `{'success': True, 'error': None}`; a fresh observe was fetched after each.\n- Latest completed action: at M=45 Q=15, submitted choice 7 (准备汇报材料) as the 1st of the quarter's 3 Energy actions (QUARTER_INTENT: Output 为最弱成长维度，3 体力全投 Output). take_action returned success=true. Fresh observe had NOT yet been fetched when this checkpoint was requested.\n\n### 4. Current Work and Active State\n- Session: ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49. Time: M=45, Q=15, year 4 (48-month game; ~3 months remaining).\n- Last fresh observe BEFORE the just-submitted action (M=45 Q=15, quarterly Energy allocation, energy_budget=3):\n  - H=10 D=10 S=123 N=54 O=38 W=35 L=L5 E=3; duration_in_level=10.\n- Latest Board (last recorded):\n  - REVIEW: 半年绩效 A（+1.5）；Leader\"能扛事、少折腾办公室政治、把功夫花在产出和关系上，半年后再看一档\"；已晋升 L5；已进入架构组（CTO 技术大会看到分享后调岗）。\n  - STICKY: 健康稳定（10）；无重大未决风险。\n- Delivery: n=0 (no tracked review-relevant work items; marker `[DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0]`).\n- MODE mostly A; briefly S (M=36) when health fell to 5 (生存约束), then returned to A after health restored to 10. Health has since oscillated (dropped to 8 twice via relationship-building/social actions, restored via 健康恢复).\n\n### 5. Immediate Resume Point\n- Last concrete action: `take_action(session_id=ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49, choice=7, notes=\"[CTRL G=visible-win P=A R=PASS X=-] [DL i=NONE n=0 focus=NONE evidence=NA checkpoint=0 recognition=0] QUARTER_INTENT:Output最弱，3体力全投可见成果。第1点：准备汇报材料(O+1,D+1)。\")` → returned `{'success': True, 'error': None}`.\n- Next step: call `observe(session_id=ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49)` to get fresh state, then continue the standard decision cycle (Board → Delivery → Planning → Risk → preflight → take_action). Note: 2 Energy points remain this quarter; intended continuation is 准备汇报材料 (choice 7) for points 2 and 3, then the quarterly Main Action (likely choice 1 申请关键项目: O+2/S+1/N+1).\n\n### 6. Pending Tasks and Next Useful Step\n- Pending: continue playing until the structured game state reports game ended; then print full `ending_score` and output `DONE`.\n- Next useful step: fresh `observe` for session ab65fb3e46964184b0936fee4d7b3c49, rebuild Board, continue loop (finish remaining 2 Energy actions + Main Action for Q=15, then proceed through months 46–48 to termination).\n\n### 7. Key Facts, Decisions, Evidence, and Fixes\n- Handbook key facts: L1–L10 levels; promotion window every 6 months (thresholds hidden); explicit statuses Health/Dignity 0–10, Skill/Network/Output unbounded, Wealth unbounded, Energy 0–3 (quarterly, non-accumulating), CurrentLevelDuration. 48 months total, max 3 events/month. Monthly flow: salary by level → events → (